ould", "write", "it", "to-day", ",", "but", "as", "it", "happens", "I", "will", "hardly", "get", "this", "in", "the", "mail", "I", "fear", "in", "time", "for", "to-day", "O", "how", "I", "want", "to", "see", "you", "all", ",", "&", "sis", "&", "Hat", "Well", "I", "have", "scratched", "out", "a", "great", "letter", ",", "just", "as", "fast", "as", "I", "could", "write", "Wednesday", "forenoon", "Mother", ",", "I", "did", "n't", "get", "the", "letter", "in", "the", "mail", "yesterday", "I", "have", "just", "had", "my", "breakfast", ",", "some", "good", "tea", "&", "good", "toast", "&", "butter", "I", "write", "this", "in", "my", "room", ",", "456", "Sixth", "st.", "the", "storm", "seems", "to", "be", "over", "dear", "Mother", ",", "I", "hope", "you", "are", "well", "&", "in", "good", "spirits", "Write", "to", "me", "often", "as", "you", "can", "&", "Jeff", "too", "any", "news", "from", "Han", "?", "Walt"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.211750305998", "recipient": "Louisa Van Velsor Whitman", "organizations": ["cold1 Jeff", "Nance2"], "sender": "Walt Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/cw/tei/loc.00816.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Letter from Walt Whitman to Louisa Van Velsor Whitman ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[["Letter", "NNP"], ["from", "IN"], [["William", "NNP"], ["E.", "NNP"], ["Vandemark", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Walt", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Walt Whitman"], "money": [], "year": "1864", "locations": [], "month": "Apr", "parties": ["William E. Vandemark", "Walt Whitman"], "properDate": "Apr 7, 1864", "gpe": [], "facility": [], "latlngs": [], "text": "  April 7/64     father i have been here to se yo and yo was not at home i leave my best wishes hoping yo are well i am very well yo must come and see me good by,  W. E. Vandermark to his father Walt Whitman.  ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["April", "NNP"], ["7/64", "CD"