"going", "to", "write", "much", "to", "you", "but", "will", "come", "&", "see", "you", "as", "soon", "as", "I", "find", "out", "where", "you", "are", "at.", "No", "more", "at", "preasant", ",", "but", "remain", "you", "[", "r", "]", "loving", "Solder", ",", "L.K.Brown"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.224262205902", "recipient": "Walt Whitman", "organizations": ["Armory Square Hosp", "Avinue", "Armory Square", "Hospital", "Gangereene"], "sender": "Lewis K. Brown", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/cw/tei/nyp.00165.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Letter from Lewis K. Brown to Walt Whitman ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[["Letter", "NNP"], ["from", "IN"], [["Walt", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Charles", "NNP"], ["W.", "NNP"], ["Eldridge", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["William", "William", "Richmond", "Walt"], "money": [], "year": "1864", "locations": [], "month": "Jul", "parties": ["Walt Whitman", "Charles W. Eldridge"], "properDate": "Jul 9, 1864", "gpe": ["Brooklyn", "Grant"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[40.65, -73.95], [47.1981147, -119.3732456]], "text": "  Brooklyn |  July 9 1864  My dear friend I rec'd the letters this afternoon, two in the envelope with a note from you. I wrote to William some five days ago   has he not rec'd it? I had grown worse, quite a good deal, & I was about making up my mind that I would have to stand a good seige   but yesterday the current changed, & I felt better all day, & in the afternoon went out riding with my brother, the first time I have been out of the house since I got home   & to-day I remain feeling better. The doctor to-day tells me my throat is markedly better   In my letter to William I told him I had rec'd his   I have also rec'd one from Nelly   it was very welcome, & I shall try to answer it soon   When you write tell me the impressions you got in the army, & the probabilities as far as you can make them out   As to me, I still believe in Grant, & that we shall get Richmond   we have heard from my brother to July 21   tell me about Ashton2   in a day or two as I get strength I shall probably go down the island    Walt ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Brooklyn", "NNP"]], ["|", ":"], ["July", "NNP"], ["9", "CD"], ["1864", "CD"], ["My", "NNP"], ["dear", "NN"], ["friend", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["rec", "VBP"], ["'d", "JJ"], ["the", "DT"], ["letters", "NNS"], ["this", "DT"], ["afternoon", "NN"], [",", ","], ["two", "CD"], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["envelope", "NN"], ["with", "IN"], ["a", "DT"], ["note", "NN"], ["from", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["wrote", "VBD"], ["to", "TO"], [["William", "NNP"]], ["some", "DT"], ["five", "CD"], ["days", "NNS"], ["ago", "RB"], ["has", "VBZ"], ["he", "PRP"], ["not", "RB"], ["rec", "VB"], ["'d", "JJ"], ["it", "PRP"], ["?", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["had", "VBD"], ["grown", "VBN"], ["worse", "NN"], [",", ","], ["quite", "RB"], ["a", "DT"], ["good", "JJ"], ["deal", "NN"], [",", ","], ["&", "CC"], ["I", "PRP"], ["was", "VBD"], ["about", "IN"], ["making", "VBG"], ["up", "RP"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["mind", "NN"], ["that", "WDT"], ["I", "PRP"], ["would", "MD"], ["have", "VB"], ["to", "TO"], ["stand", "VB"], ["a", "DT"], ["good", "JJ"], ["seige", "NN"], ["but", "CC"], ["yesterday", "NN"], ["the", "DT"], ["current", "JJ"], ["changed", "VBN"], [",", ","], ["&", "CC"], ["I", "PRP"], ["felt", "VBD"], ["better", "RBR"], ["all", "DT"], ["day", "NN"], [",", ","], ["&", "CC"], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["afternoon", "NN"], ["went", "VBD"], ["out", "IN"], ["riding", "NN"], ["with", "IN"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["brother", "NN"], [",", ","], ["the", "DT"], ["first", "JJ"], ["time", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["been", "VBN"], ["out", "RP"], ["of", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["house", "NN"], ["since", "IN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["got", "VBD"], ["home", "NN"], ["&", "CC"], ["to-day", "NNP"], ["I", "NNP"], ["remain", "NN"], ["feeling"