 "all", "their", "trials", "I", "wish", "you", "to", "enclose", "this", "in", "your", "next", "letter", "to", "Nelly", "I", "wish", "you", "to", "give", "my", "remembrance", "&", "love", "to", "the", "Howells,6", "to", "Miss", "Howard7", "&", "to", "Arnold", "Johnson8", "Write", "soon", "&", "tell", "me", "all", "the", "news", "tell", "me", "how", "is", "Ashton", "Good", "bye", "&", "God", "bless", "you", ",", "my", "dear", "friend", "Walt"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.226710186319", "recipient": "William D.", "organizations": ["Navy Reports", "Arnold"], "sender": "Walt Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/cw/tei/nyp.00191.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Letter from Walt Whitman to William D. O'Connor ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[["Letter", "NNP"], ["from", "IN"], [["George", "NNP"], ["Washington", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Louisa", "NNP"], ["Van", "NNP"], ["Velsor", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Well"], "money": [], "year": "1864", "locations": [], "month": "Jul", "parties": ["George Washington Whitman", "Louisa Van Velsor Whitman"], "properDate": "Jul 26, 1864", "gpe": ["Petersburg", "Camp"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[-23.8961708, 29.4486263], [-23.8961708, 29.4486263]], "text": "  In front of Petersburg Va. Wednesday Evening  July 26th/64 Dear Mother. All quiet in front of Petersburg, and everything going on just the same as when I last wrote. We came out from the front line, last night and are now at our camp, in the woods about half a mile from the enemy's works. We go up  in front and stay 48 hours and then come back here and stay the next 48. I received Walts letter of July 14th and am looking every day to hear from you again. Mother I hope you are all well at home,  Walt I hope is all right before now.1 I have never been heartier than I have been this summer,  we live very well here and are a great deal more comfortable than one would think. I wrote you last, about the 13th of this month,  did you get the letter. We are kept pretty buissy, while we are back in Camp, makeing out papers for men who are sent away sick or wounded, but still we dont kill ourselvs with hard work. Well Mother it is getting late and I am getting sleeppy, so good night,  I will write again soon. Much love to all. G. W. Whitman", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["In", "IN"], ["front", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], [["Petersburg", "NNP"]], ["Va.", "NNP"], ["Wednesday", "NNP"], ["Evening", "NNP"], ["July", "NNP"], ["26th/64", "CD"], ["Dear", "NNP"], ["Mother", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["All", "DT"], ["quiet", "JJ"], ["in", "IN"], ["front", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], [["Petersburg", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["and", "CC"], ["everything", "NN"], ["going", "VBG"], ["on", "IN"], ["just", "RB"], ["the", "DT"], ["same", "JJ"], ["as", "IN"], ["when", "WRB"], ["I", "PRP"], ["last", "VBP"], ["wrote", "VBD"], [".", "."]], [["We", "PRP"], ["came", "VBD"], ["out", "RP"], ["from", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["front", "NN"], ["line", "NN"], [",", ","], ["last", "JJ"], ["night", "NN"], ["and", "CC"], ["are", "VBP"], ["now", "RB"], ["at", "IN"], ["our", "PRP$"], ["camp", "NN"], [",", ","], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["woods", "NNS"], ["about", "IN"], ["half", "DT"], ["a", "DT"], ["mile", "JJ"], ["from", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["enemy", "NN"], ["'s", "POS"], ["works", "NNS"], [".", "."]], [["We", "PRP"], ["go", "VBP"], ["up", "RP"], ["in", "IN"], ["front", "NN"], ["and", "CC"], ["stay", "NN"], ["48", "CD"], ["hours", "NNS"], ["and", "CC"], ["then", "RB"], ["come", "VBN"], ["back", "RB"], ["here", "RB"], ["and", "CC"], ["stay", "NN"], ["the", "DT"], ["next", "JJ"], ["48", "CD"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["received", "VBD"], ["Walts", "NNS"], ["letter", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["July", "NNP"], ["14th", "CD"], ["and", "CC"], ["am", "NN"], ["looking", "VBG"], ["every", "DT"], ["day", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["hear", "VB"], ["from", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["again", "RB"], [".", "."]], [["Mother", "NNP"], ["I", "PRP"], ["hope", "VBP"], ["you", "PRP"], ["are", "VBP"], ["all", "DT"], ["well", "RB"], ["at", "IN"], ["home", "NN"], [",", ","], ["Walt", "NNP"], ["I", "PRP"], ["hope", "VBP"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["all", "DT"], ["right", "RB"], ["before", "IN"], ["now.1", "-NONE-"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["never", "RB"], ["been", "VBN"], ["heartier", "JJR"], ["than", "IN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["been", "VBN"], ["this", "DT"], ["summer", "NN"], [",", ","], ["we", "PRP"], ["live", "VBP"], ["very", "RB"], ["well", "RB"], ["here", "RB"], ["and", "CC"], ["are", "VBP"], ["a", "DT"], ["great", "JJ"], ["deal", "NN"], ["more", "RBR"], ["comfortable", "JJ"], ["than", "IN"], ["one", "CD"], ["would", "MD"], ["think", "VB"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["wrote", "VBD"], ["you", "PRP"], ["last", "JJ"], [",", ","], ["about", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["13th", "JJ"], ["of", "IN"], ["this", "DT"], ["month", "NN"], [",", ","], ["did", "VBD"], ["you", "PRP"], ["get", "VB"], ["the", "DT"], ["letter", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["We", "PRP"], ["are", "VBP"], ["kept", "VBN"], ["pretty", "RB"], ["buissy", "JJ"], [",", ","], ["while", "IN"], ["we", "PRP"], ["are", "VBP"], ["back", "RB"], ["in", "IN"], [["Camp", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["makeing", "VBG"], ["out", "RP"], ["papers", "NNS"], ["for", "IN"], ["men", "NNS"], ["who", "WP"], ["are", "VBP"], ["sent", "VBN"], ["away", "RB"], ["sick", "JJ"], ["or", "CC"], ["wounded", "VBN"], [",", ","], ["but", "CC"], ["still", "RB"], ["we", "PRP"], ["dont", "VBP"], ["kill", "RB"], ["ourselvs", "VBZ"], ["with", "IN"], ["hard", "JJ"], ["work", "NN"], [".", "."]], [[["Well", "NNP"]], ["Mother", "NNP"], ["it", "PRP"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["getting", "VBG"], ["late", "JJ"], ["and", "CC"], ["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["getting", "VBG"], ["sleeppy", "NN"], [",", ","], ["so", "RB"], ["good", "JJ"], ["night", "NN"], [",", ","], ["I", "PRP"], ["will", "MD"], ["write", "VB"], ["again", "RB"], ["soon", "RB"], [".", "."]], [["Much", "RB"], ["love", "VBP"], ["to", "TO"], ["all", "DT"], [".", "."]], [["G.", "NNP"], ["W.", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]]], "sentences": ["  In front of Petersburg Va. Wednesday Evening  July 26th/64 Dear Mother.", "All quiet in front of Petersburg, and everything going on just the same as when I last wrote.", "We came out from the front line, last night and are now at our camp, in the woods about half a mile from the enemy's works.", "We go up  in front and stay 48 hours and then come back here and stay the next 48.", "I received Walts letter of July 14th and am looking every day to hear from you again.", "Mother I hope you are all well at home,  Walt I hope is all right before now.1 I have never been heartier than I have been this summer,  we live very well here and are a great deal more comfortable than one would think.", "I wrote you last, about the 13th of this month,  did you get the letter.", "We are kept pretty buissy, while we are back in Camp, makeing out papers for men who are sent away sick or wounded, but still we dont kill ourselvs with hard work.", "Well Mother it is getting late and I am getting sleeppy, so good night,  I will write again soon.", "Much love to all.", "G. W. Whitman"], "words": ["In", "front", "of", "Petersburg", "Va.", "Wednesday", "Evening", "July", "26th/64", "Dear", "Mother.", "All", "quiet", "in", "front", "of", "Petersburg", ",", "and", "everything", "going", "on", "just", "the", "same", "as", "when", "I", "last", "wrote.", "We", "came", "out", "from", "the", "front", "line", ",", "last", "night", "and", "are", "now", "at", "our", "camp", ",", "in", "the", "woods", "about", "half", "a", "mile", "from", "the", "enemy", "'s", "works.", "We", "go", "up", "in", "front", "and", "stay", "48", "hours", "and", "then", "come", "back", "here", "and", "stay", "the", "next", "48.", "I", "received", "Walts", "letter", "of", "July", "14th", "and", "am", "looking", "every", "day", "to", "hear", "from", "you", "again.", "Mother", "I", "hope", "you", "are", "all", "well", "at", "home", ",", "Walt", "I", "hope", "is", "all", "right", "before", "now.1", "I", "have", "never", "been", "heartier", "than", "I", "have", "been", "this", "summer", ",", "we", "live", "very", "well", "here", "and", "are", "a", "great", "deal", "more", "comfortable", "than", "one", "would", "think.", "I", "wrote", "you", "last", ",", "about", "the", "13th", "of", "this", "month", ",", "did", "you", "get", "the", "letter.", "We", "are", "kept", "pretty", "buissy", ",", "while", "we", "are", "back", "in", "Camp", ",", "makeing", "out", "papers", "for", "men", "who", "are", "sent", "away", "sick", "or", "wounded", ",", "but", "still", "we", "dont", "kill", "ourselvs", "with", "hard", "work.", "Well", "Mother", "it", "is", "getting", "late", "and", "I", "am", "getting", "sleeppy", ",", "so", "good", "night", ",", "I", "will", "write", "again", "soon.", "Much", "love", "to", "all.", "G.", "W.", "Whitman"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.226982184143", "recipient": "Louisa Van Velsor Whitman", "organizations": ["Petersburg"], "sender": "George Washington Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/cw/tei/duk.00358.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Letter from George Washington Whitman to Louisa Van Velsor Whitman ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[["Letter", "NNP"], ["from", "IN"], [["John", "NNP"], ["Burroughs", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Walt", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Dear", "Drum Taps", "John Burroughs"], "money": [], "year": "1864", "locations": [], "month": "Aug", "parties": ["John Burroughs", "Walt Whitman"], "properDate": "Aug 2, 1864", "gpe": ["Walt", "Washington"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[38.8951118, -77.0363658]], "text": " Dear Walt, I am disconsolate at your long stay.  What has become of you?  On returning the 7th of July I found you had gone home sick.  You have no business to be sick, so I expect you are well.  I was so unlucky as to be sick all the time I was home   and most of the time since I came back.  I am quite well now, however, and feel like myself.  Benton2 and I looked for you at Leedsville, as I wrote to you to come.  If you have leisure now you would enjoy hugely a visit up there.  I hope you are printing Drum Taps, and that this universal drought does not reach your \"grass.\"  But make haste and come back.  The heat is delicious.  I have a constant bath in my own perspiration.  I was out at the front during the siege of Washington and lay in the rifle pits with the soldiers.  I got quite a taste of war and learned the song of those modern minstrels   the minnie bullets   by heart.  A line from you would be prized.  Truly yours John Burroughs  ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Dear", "NNP"]], [["Walt", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["disconsolate", "JJ"], ["at", "IN"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["long", "JJ"], ["stay", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["What", "WP"], ["has", "VBZ"], ["become", "VBN"], ["of", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["?", "."]], [["On", "IN"], ["returning", "NN"], ["the", "DT"], ["7th", "JJ"], ["of", "IN"], ["July", "NNP"], ["I", "NNP"], ["found", "VBD"], ["you", "PRP"], ["had", "VBD"], ["gone", "VBN"], ["home", "NN"], ["sick", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["You", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["no", "DT"], ["business", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["be", "VB"], ["sick", "JJ"], [",", ","], ["so", "RB"], ["I", "PRP"], ["expect", "VBP"], ["you", "PRP"], ["are", "VBP"], ["well", "RB"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["was", "VBD"], ["so", "RB"], ["unlucky", "JJ"], ["as", "IN"], ["to", "TO"], ["be", "VB"], ["sick", "JJ"], ["all", "DT"], ["the", "DT"], ["time", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["was", "VBD"], ["home", "RB"], ["and", "CC"], ["most", "JJS"], ["of", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["time", "NN"], ["since", "IN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["came", "VBD"], ["back", "RB"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["quite", "RB"], ["well", "RB"], ["now", "RB"], [