A pretty hard time of it this summer   A marching & fighting together dear walt I am so glad to hear from you once more I would like to see you verry much  I have drempt of you often & thought of you oftener still I expect to leave here tomorrow morning for Carlisle barraks I was to gow this morning but did not & now I am to gow tomorrow morning  I guess that they wont put it off anny longer my time is out in eleven days now  I have bin home on A furlow I shant have to do anny more fighting I think   Write soon   no more at present thew   Smith  ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Friend", "NN"]], [["Walt", "NNP"]], ["I", "PRP"], ["received", "VBD"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["letter", "NN"], ["today", "NN"], ["&", "CC"], ["was", "VBD"], ["verry", "JJ"], ["glad", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["hear", "VB"], ["from", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["wonse", "VBP"], ["more", "JJR"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["bin", "VBN"], ["wounded", "VBN"], ["again", "RB"], ["but", "CC"], ["it", "PRP"], ["has", "VBZ"], ["got", "VBN"], ["well", "RB"], ["it", "PRP"], ["hit", "VBD"], ["me", "PRP"], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["right", "NN"], ["thigh", "NN"], ["this", "DT"], ["time", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["had", "VBN"], ["A", "DT"], ["pretty", "RB"], ["hard", "JJ"], ["time", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["this", "DT"], ["summer", "NN"], ["A", "DT"], ["marching", "NN"], ["&", "CC"], ["fighting", "VBG"], ["together", "RP"], ["dear", "JJ"], ["walt", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["so", "RB"], ["glad", "JJ"], ["to", "TO"], ["hear", "VB"], ["from", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["once", "RB"], ["more", "RBR"], ["I", "PRP"], ["would", "MD"], ["like", "VB"], ["to", "TO"], ["see", "VB"], ["you", "PRP"], ["verry", "VB"], ["much", "JJ"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["drempt", "VBN"], ["of", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["often", "RB"], ["&", "CC"], ["thought", "VBD"], ["of", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["oftener", "JJR"], ["still", "RB"], ["I", "PRP"], ["expect", "VBP"], ["to", 