s to late now & I did not hear of it in time there is [illegible] considerable excitement here about the election. my health is not verry good at present I have got diarrhea some I think that it is on account of the change of climate & of food that makes me so although I feel verry well no more at present  good by From B Smith to Friend Walt  Address Bethuel Smith. Glens Falls. Warren. C.O.        N.Y.  ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["[", "NN"], ["illegible", "JJ"], ["]", "NN"], ["burg", "NN"], ["Oct.", "NNP"], ["22", "CD"], ["1864", "CD"], ["Dear", "NNP"], ["friend", "NN"], ["walt", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["arrived", "VBD"], ["home", "NN"], ["the", "DT"], ["18", "CD"], ["I", "PRP"], ["had", "VBD"], ["to", "TO"], ["[", "VB"], ["stop", "JJ"], ["?", "."]], [["]", "NN"], ["over", "IN"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["[", "NN"], ["illegible", "JJ"], ["]", "NN"], ["on", "IN"], ["account", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], [["Sheridan", "NNP"]], ["fighting", "NN"], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["valley", "NN"], ["mother", "NN"], ["told", "VBD"], ["me", "PRP"], ["that", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["wanted", "VBD"], ["me", "PRP"], ["to", "TO"], ["stop", "VB"], ["&", "CC"], ["see", "VB"], ["you", "PRP"], ["when", "WRB"], ["I", "PRP"], ["come", "VBP"], ["home", "RB"], ["but", "CC"], ["it", "PRP"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["to", "TO"], ["late", "JJ"], ["now", "RB"], ["&", "CC"], ["I", "PRP"], ["did", "VBD"], ["not", "RB"], ["hear", "VB"], ["of", "IN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["in", "IN"], ["time", "NN"], ["there", "EX"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["[", ":"], ["illegible", "JJ"], ["]", "NN"], ["considerable", "JJ"], ["excitement", "NN"], ["here", "RB"], ["about", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["election", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["my", "PRP$"], ["health", "NN"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["not", "RB"], ["verry", "JJ"], ["good", "JJ"], ["at", "IN"], ["present", "JJ"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["got", "VBN"], ["diarrhea", "NN"], ["some", "DT"], ["I", "PRP"], ["think", "VBP"], ["that", "IN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["on", "IN"], ["account", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["change", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["climate", "NN"], ["&", "CC"], ["of", "IN"], ["food", "NN"], ["that", "IN"], ["makes", "VBZ"], ["me", "PRP"], ["so", "RB"], ["although", "IN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["feel", "VBP"], ["verry", "JJ"], ["well", "RB"], ["no", "DT"], ["more", "RBR"], ["at", "IN"], ["present", "NN"], ["good", "NN"], ["by", "IN"], [["From", "NNP"]], ["B", "NNP"], ["Smith", "NNP"], ["to", "TO"], [["Friend", "NNP"], ["Walt", "NNP"], ["Address", "NNP"], ["Bethuel", "NNP"], ["Smith", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [["Glens", "NNS"], ["Falls", "NNS"], [".", "."]], [[["Warren", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [["C.O", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["N.Y", "JJ"], [".", "."]]], "sentences": ["  [illegible]burg Oct. 22 1864  Dear friend walt I arrived home the 18 I had to [stop?", "] over my [illegible] on account of Sheridan fighting in the valley mother told me that you wanted me to stop & see you when I come home but it is to late now & I did not hear of it in time there is [illegible] considerable excitement here about the election.", "my health is not verry good at present I have got diarrhea some I think that it is on account of the change of climate & of food that makes me so although I feel verry well no more at present  good by From B Smith to Friend Walt  Address Bethuel Smith.", "Glens Falls.", "Warren.", "C.O.", "N.Y.  "], "words": ["[", "illegible", "]", "burg", "Oct.", "22", "1864", "Dear", "friend", "walt", "I", "arrived", "home", "the", "18", "I", "had", "to", "[", "stop", "?", "]", "over", "my", "[", "illegible", "]", "on", "account", "of", "Sheridan", "fighting", "in", "the", "valley", "mother", "told", "me", "that", "you", "wanted", "me", "to", "stop", "&", "see", "you", "when", "I", "come", "home", "but", "it", "is", "to", "late", "now", "&", "I", "did", "not", "hear", "of", "it", "in", "time", "there", "is", "[", "illegible", "]", "considerable", "excitement", "here", "about", "the", "election.", "my", "health", "is", "not", "verry", "good", "at", "present", "I", "have", "got", "diarrhea", "some", "I", "think", "that", "it", "is", "on", "account", "of", "the", "change", "of", "climate", "&", "of", "food", "that", "makes", "me", "so", "although", "I", "feel", "verry", "well", "no", "more", "at", "present", "good", "by", "From", "B", "Smith", "to", "Friend", "Walt", "Address", "Bethuel", "Smith.", "Glens", "Falls.", "Warren.", "C.O.", "N.Y", "."], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.238950088399", "recipient": "Walt Whitman", "organizations": [], "sender": "Bethuel Smith", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/cw/tei/loc.00882.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Letter from Bethuel Smith to Walt Whitman ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[["Letter", "NNP"], ["from", "IN"], [["George", "NNP"], ["Washington", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Louisa", "NNP"], ["Van", "NNP"], ["Velsor", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Danville Va", "Libby Prison", "Major Wright", "Lieuts Pooley", "Capt Walton3", "Lieut Butler4"], "money": [], "year": "1864", "locations": [], "month": "Oct", "parties": ["George Washington Whitman", "Louisa Van Velsor Whitman"], "properDate": "Oct 23, 1864", "gpe": ["Lieut"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [], "text": "  Danville Va,  October 23d 1864 Dear Mother. I wrote you a line from Libby Prison a few days after I was taken prisoner, but think it doubtfull if you received it. I was taken, (along with almost our entire Regt. both Officers and men) on the 30th day of September, near the Weldon Rail Road, but am proud to think that we stood and fought untill we were entirely surrounded,  Major Wright, Lieuts Pooley, Sims,1 and 9 other Officers2 of our Regt, are here,  Capt Walton3 and Lieut Butler4 was wounded, but I dont know how badly,  I am very well indeed, and in tip top spirits, am tough as a mule, and about as ugly, and can eat any amount of corn bread, so you see, dear Mother that I am all right, and my greatest trouble is that you will worry about me, but I beg of you not to frett, as I get along first rate.5 Please write to Lieut. Babcock6 Co. F of our Regt. and tell him to send my things home by Express. Much love to all.  G. W. Whitman ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Danville", "NNP"], ["Va", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["October", "NNP"], ["23d", "CD"], ["1864", "CD"], ["Dear", "NNP"], ["Mother", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["wrote", "VBD"], ["you", "PRP"], ["a", "DT"], ["line", "NN"], ["from", "IN"], [["Libby", "NNP"], ["Prison", "NNP"]], ["a", "DT"], ["few", "JJ"], ["days", "NNS"], ["after", "IN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["was", "VBD"], ["taken", "VBN"], ["prisoner", "NN"], [",", ","], ["but", "CC"], ["think", "VBP"], ["it", "PRP"], ["doubtfull", "RB"], ["if", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["received", "VBD"], ["it", "PRP"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["was", "VBD"], ["taken", "VBN"], [",", ","], ["(", "NNP"], ["along", "IN"], ["with", "IN"], ["almost", "RB"], ["our", "PRP$"], ["entire", "JJ"], ["Regt", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["both", "DT"], ["Officers", "NNP"], ["and", "CC"], ["men", "NNS"], [")", ":"], ["on", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["30th", "JJ"], ["day", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["September", "NNP"], [",", ","], ["near", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], [["Weldon", "NNP"], ["Rail", "NNP"], ["Road", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["but", "CC"], ["am", "VBP"], ["proud", "VBN"], ["to", "TO"], ["think", "VB"], ["that", "IN"], ["we", "PRP"], ["stood", "VBD"], ["and", "CC"], ["fought", "NN"], ["untill", "NN"], ["we", "PRP"], ["were", "VBD"], ["entirely", "RB"], ["surrounded", "VBN"], [",", ","], [["Major", "NNP"], ["Wright", "NNP"]], [",", ","], [["Lieuts", "NNP"], ["Pooley", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["Sims,1", "-NONE-"], ["and", "CC"], ["9", "CD"], ["other", "JJ"], ["Officers2", "NNP"], ["of", "IN"], ["our", "PRP$"], ["Regt", "NNP"], [",", ","], ["are", "VBP"], ["here", "RB"], [",", ","], [["Capt", "NNP"], ["Walton3", "NNP"]], ["and", "CC"], [["Lieut", "NNP"