ou and could not hear what had become of you. you stated in yours that you hoped that I had not forgotten you. I never will forget you so long as life should last. Uncle I have got very near well. the wound in my chest has got nearly well. I am so that I can go about and do light duty. Also my arm is geting along nicely but their is some slight pain yet but none to stop me from writing such a kind and affectionate friend as you have been to me. May god bless you forever I cant find words to tell you the love thier is in me for you. I hope you & I may live to meet again on this earth if not I hope we shall meet in the world w[h]ere there is no more parting   I will close hopeing to hear from you again soon  Very Respectfully, Your Obedient Servant & loving friend,  ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["My", "PRP$"], ["Dear", "NNP"], ["Sir", "NNP"], ["It", "NNP"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["with", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["greatest", "JJS"], ["pleasure", "NN"], ["that", "WDT"], ["I", "PRP"], ["seat", "VBP"], ["myself", "PRP"], ["to", "TO"], ["give", "VB"], ["you", "PRP"], ["a", "DT"], ["few", "JJ"], ["lines", "NNS"], ["to", "TO"], ["let", "VB"], ["you", "PRP"], ["know", "VB"], ["that", "IN"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["most", "RBS"], ["welcome", "JJ"], ["letter", "NN"], ["came", "VBD"], ["safe", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["hand", "VB"], ["and", "CC"], ["you", "PRP"], ["dont", "VBP"], ["know", "VBP"], ["how", "WRB"], ["glad", "JJ"], ["I", "PRP"], ["was", "VBD"], ["to", "TO"], ["hear", "VB"], ["from", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["I", "PRP"], ["often", "RB"], ["thought", "VBD"], ["of", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["and", "CC"], ["could", "MD"], ["not", "RB"], ["hear", "VB"], ["what", "WP"], ["had", "VBD"], ["become", "VBN"], ["of", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], [".", "."]], [["you", "PRP"], ["stated", "VBD"], ["in", "IN"], ["yours", "NNS"], ["that", "WDT"], ["you", "PRP"], ["hoped", "VBD"], ["that", "IN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["had", "VBD"], ["not", "RB"], ["forgotten", "VBN"], ["you", "PRP"], [".", "