, "VBG"], ["a", "DT"], ["few", "JJ"], ["hours", "NNS"], ["a", "DT"], ["day", "NN"], [",", ","], ["a", "DT"], ["sufficiently", "RB"], ["remunerative", "JJ"], ["desk", "NN"], ["in", "IN"], [["Indian", "NNP"]], ["office", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["spend", "VBP"], ["a", "DT"], ["couple", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["hours", "NNS"], ["day", "NN"], ["or", "CC"], ["evening", "VBG"], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["hospitals", "NNS"], [".", "."]], [[["Farewell", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"], ["Washington", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["D.C", "NNP"], [".", "."]]], "sentences": ["  Washington  Friday, March 3, '65.", "My dear Trowbridge, Your letter has reached me   my best thanks for your contribution to the wounded & sick, & shall be applied in most needy cases.", "You speak of seeing Dr. Russell1   has he not rec'd a N. Y.", "Times of two months since containing a sketch of my Visits to Hospitals2   I thought one had been sent him.", "If he has not had one I should like to send one to him.", "The paragraph in the Gazette by Mr Shillaber is very kind.", "I do not wish you to send me any of the papers.", "Nothing new or special with me   I believe I told you I was working a few hours a day, a sufficiently remunerative desk in Indian office   I spend a couple of hours day or evening in the hospitals.", "Farewell.", "Walt Whitman Washington, D.C. "], "words": ["Washington", "Friday", ",", "March", "3", ",", "'65.", "My", "dear", "Trowbridge", ",", "Your", "letter", "has", "reached", "me", "my", "best", "thanks", "for", "your", "contribution", "to", "the", "wounded", "&", "sick", ",", "&", "shall", "be", "applied", "in", "most", "needy", "cases.", "You", "speak", "of", "seeing", "Dr.", "Russell1", "has", "he", "not", "rec", "'d", "a", "N.", "Y.", "Times", "of", "two", "months", "since", "containing", "a", "sketch", "of", "my", "Visits", "to", "Hospitals2", "I", "thought", "one", "had", "been", "sent", "him.", "If", "he", "has", "not", "had", "one", "I", "should", "like", "to", "send", "one", "to", "him.", "The", "paragraph", "in", "the", "Gazette", "by", "Mr", "Shillaber", "is", "very", "kind.", "I", "do", "not", "wish", "you", "to", "send", "me", "any", "of", "the", "papers.", "Nothing", "new", "or", "special", "with", "me", "I", "believe", "I", "told", "you", "I", "was", "working", "a", "few", "hours", "a", "day", ",", "a", "sufficiently", "remunerative", "desk", "in", "Indian", "office", "I", "spend", "a", "couple", "of", "hours", "day", "or", "evening", "in", "the", "hospitals.", "Farewell.", "Walt", "Whitman", "Washington", ",", "D.C", "."], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.256901944784", "recipient": "John Townsend Trowbridge", "organizations": ["Hospitals2"], "sender": "Walt Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/cw/tei/sta.00002.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Letter from Walt Whitman to John Townsend Trowbridge ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[["Letter", "NNP"], ["from", "IN"], [["Celia", "NNP"], ["M.", "NNP"], ["Burr", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Walt", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Troy", "Walt Whitman", "Celia", "Madame Willard"], "money": [], "year": "1865", "locations": [], "month": "Mar", "parties": ["Celia M. Burr", "Walt Whitman"], "properDate": "Mar 7, 1865", "gpe": ["Washington"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[38.8951118, -77.0363658]], "text": "  Troy March 7th 65  Your last letter from Washington in the paper lying on my lap   Your book in the hands of my friend Lucy who sits there by the window reading it in the morning sunshine.  She looks up suddenly and says \"I think this is the soul I am waiting for, is Walt Whitman married?\"  I cannot answer the question, but will you?   I am not interested to know if you are married, but I would like to look in your face.  How many years did you live ere you could look into the depths of all hearts.  Through what experiences did you learn that lore?  Remember, if ever the opportunity comes I will look in your face.  It should say all that is in your book and something more.  I want that something more.  Celia M. Burr (Care of Madame Willard) Troy N.Y.)  ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Troy", "NNP"]], ["March", "NNP"], ["7th", "CD"], ["65", "CD"], ["Your", "NNP"], ["last", "JJ"], ["letter", "NN"], ["from", "IN"], [["Washington", "NNP"]], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["paper", "NN"], ["lying", "VBG"], ["on", "IN"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["lap", "NN"], ["Your", "NNP"], ["book", "NN"], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["hands", "NNS"], ["of", "IN"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["friend", "NN"], ["Lucy", "NNP"], ["who", "WP"], ["sits", "VBZ"], ["there", "RB"], ["by", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["window", "NN"], ["reading", "NN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["morning", "NN"], ["sunshine", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["She", "PRP"], ["looks", "VBZ"], ["up", "RP"], ["suddenly", "RB"], ["and", "CC"], ["says", "VBZ"], ["``", "``"], ["I", "PRP"], ["think", "VBP"], ["this", "DT"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["the", "DT"], ["soul", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["waiting", "VBG"], ["for", "IN"], [",", ","], ["is", "VBZ"], [["Walt", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["married", "VBD"], ["?", "."]], [["``", "``"], ["I", "PRP"], ["can", "MD"], ["not", "RB"], ["answer", "VB"], ["the", "DT"], ["question", "NN"], [",", ","], ["but", "CC"], ["will", "MD"], ["you", "PRP"], ["?", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["not", "RB"], ["interested", "JJ"], ["to", "TO"], ["know", "VB"], ["if", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["are", "VBP"], ["married", "VBN"], [",", ","], ["but", "CC"], ["I", "PRP"], ["would", "MD"], ["like", "VB"], ["to", "TO"], ["look", "VB"], ["in", "IN"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["face", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["How", "WRB"], ["many", "JJ"], ["years", "NNS"], ["did", "VBD"], ["you", "PRP"], ["live", "VBP"], ["ere", "RB"], ["you", "PRP"], ["could", "MD"], ["look", "VB"], ["into", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["depths", "NNS"], ["of", "IN"], ["all", "DT"], ["hearts", "NNS"], [".", "."]], [["Through", "IN"], ["what", "WP"], ["experiences", "NNS"], ["did", "VBD"], ["you", "PRP"], ["learn", "VB"], ["that", "DT"], ["lore", "NN"], ["?", "."]], [["Remember", "NNP"], [",", ","], ["if", "IN"], ["ever", "RB"], ["the", "DT"], ["opportunity", "NN"], ["comes", "VBZ"], ["I", "PRP"], ["will", "MD"], ["look", "VB"], ["in", "IN"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["face", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["It", "PRP"], ["should", "MD"], ["say", "VB"], ["all", "DT"], ["that", "DT"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["in", "IN"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["book", "NN"], ["and", "CC"], ["something", "NN"], ["more", "RBR"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["want", "VBP"], ["that", "IN"], ["something", "NN"], ["more", "JJR"], [".", "."]], [[["Celia", "NNP"]], ["M.", "NNP"], ["Burr", "NNP"], ["(", "NNP"], ["Care", "NNP"], ["of", "IN"], [["Madame", "NNP"], ["Willard", "NNP"]], [")", "NNP"], ["Troy", "NNP"], ["N.Y", "NNP"], [".", "."], [")", ":"]]], "sentences": ["  Troy March 7th 65  Your last letter from Washington in the paper lying on my lap   Your book in the hands of my friend Lucy who sits there by the window reading it in the morning sunshine.", "She looks up suddenly and says \"I think this is the soul I am waiting for, is Walt Whitman married?", "\"  I cannot answer the question, but will you?", "I am not interested to know if you are married, but I would like to look in your face.", "How many years did you live ere you could look into the depths of all hearts.", "Through what experiences did you learn that lore?", "Remember, if ever the opportunity comes I will look in your face.", "It should say all that is in your book and something more.", "I want that something more.", "Celia M. Burr (Care of Madame Willard) Troy N.Y.)  "], "words": ["Troy", "March", "7th", "65", "Your", "last", "letter", "from", "Washington", "in", "the", "paper", "lying", "on", "my", "lap", "Your", "book", "in", "the", "hands", "of", "my", "friend", "Lucy", "who", "sits", "there", "by", "the", "window", "reading", "it", "in", "the", "morning", "sunshine.", "She", "looks", "up", "suddenly", "and", "says", "``", "I", "think", "this", "is", "the", "soul", "I", "am", "waiting", "for", ",", "is", "Walt", "Whitman", "married", "?", "''", "I", "can", "not", "answer", "the", "question", ",", "but", "will", "you", "?", "I", "am", "not", "interested", "to", "know", "if", "you", "are", "married", ",", "but", "I", "would", "like", "to", "look", "in", "your", "face.", "How", "many", "years", "did", "you", "live", "ere", "you", "could", "look", "into", "the", "depths", "of", "all", "hearts.", "Through", "what", "experiences", "did", "you", "learn", "that", "lore", "?", "Remember", ",", "if", "ever", "the", "opportunity", "comes", "I", "will", "look", "in", "your", "face.", "It", "should", "say", "all", "that", "is", "in", "your", "book", "and", "something", "more.", "I", "want", "that", "something", "more.", "Celia", "M.", "Burr", "(", "Care", "of", "Madame", "Willard", ")", "Troy", "N.Y", ".", ")"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.257445940432", "recipient": "Walt Whitman", "organizations": [], "sender": "Celia M. Burr", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/cw/tei/loc.00849.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Letter from Celia M. Burr to Walt Whitman ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[["Letter", "NNP"], ["from", "IN"], [["Walt", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Dana", "NNP"], ["F.", "NNP"], ["Wright", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Capt", "George", "Brooklyn New York How", "Major Wright", "Walt", "Whitman"], "money": [], "year": "1865", "locations": [], "month": "Mar", "parties": ["Walt Whitman", "Dana F. Wright"], "properDate": "Mar 13, 1865", "gpe": ["Washington", "Capt", "Portland", "Myrtle", "New York", "Washington"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[38.8951118, -77.0363658], [45.5234515, -122.6762071], [52.1054611, -119.6489096], [40.7143528, -74.00597309999999], [38.8951118, -77.0363658]], "text": "  Washington, |  March 13, 1865  My dear Sir:1 Would you do me the favor, if convenient, immediately on receiving this, of enclosing the sketch by Capt. Sims,2 and directing it, Capt. George W. Whitman, Portland Av. near Myrtle, Brooklyn New York    How are you getting along in New York and how is your brother, Major Wright?3   I send him best regards. I am still here in Washington, and nothing new. Yours, etc. Walt Whitman ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Washington", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["|", "NNP"], ["March", "NNP"], ["13", "CD"], [",", ","], ["1865", "CD"], ["My", "NNP"], ["dear", "NN"], ["Sir:1", "-NONE-"], ["Would", "MD"], ["you", "PRP"], ["do", "VB"], ["me", "PRP"], ["the", "DT"], ["favor", "NN"], [",", ","], ["if", "IN"], ["convenient", "JJ"], [",", ","], ["immediately", "RB"], ["on", "IN"], ["receiving", "VBG"], ["this", "DT"], [",", ","], ["of", "IN"], ["enclosing", "NN"], ["the", "DT"], ["sketch", "NN"], ["by", "IN"], [["Capt", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [["Sims,2", "-NONE-"], ["and", "CC"], ["directing", "VBG"], ["it", "PRP"], [",", ","], [["Capt", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [[["George", "NNP"]], ["W.", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"], [",", ","], [["Portland", "NNP"]], ["Av", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["near", "IN"], [["Myrtle", "NNP"]], [",", ","], [["Brooklyn", "NNP"], ["New", "NNP"], ["York", "NNP"], ["How", "NNP"]], ["are", "VBP"], ["you", "PRP"], ["getting", "VBG"], ["along", "IN"], ["in", "IN"], [["New", "NNP"], ["York", "NNP"]], ["and", "CC"], ["how", "WRB"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["brother", "NN"], [",", ","], [["Major", "NNP"], ["Wright", "NNP"]], ["?", "."], ["3", "CD"], ["I", "PRP"], ["send", "VBP"], ["him", "PRP"], ["best", "JJS"], ["regards", "NNS"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["still", "RB"], ["here", "RB"], ["in", "IN"], [["Washington", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["and", "CC"], ["nothing", "NN"], ["new", "JJ"], [".", "."]], [["Yours", "NNS"], [",", ","], ["etc", "NN"], [".", "."]], [[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]]]], "sentences": ["  Washington, |  March 13, 1865  My dear Sir:1 Would you do me the favor, if convenient, immediately on receiving this, of enclosing the sketch by Capt.", "Sims,2 and directing it, Capt.", "George W. Whitman, Portland Av.", "near Myrtle, Brooklyn New York    How are you getting along in New York and how is your brother, Major Wright?3   I send him best regards.", "I am still here in Washington, and nothing new.", "Yours, etc.", "Walt Whitman "], "words": ["Washington", ",", "|", "March", "13", ",", "1865", "My", "dear", "Sir:1", "Would", "you", "do", "me", "the", "favor", ",", "if", "convenient", ",", "immediately", "on", "receiving", "this", ",", "of", "enclosing", "the", "sketch", "by", "Capt.", "Sims,2", "and", "directing", "it", ",", "Capt.", "George", "W.", "Whitman", ",", "Portland", "Av.", "near", "Myrtle", ",", "Brooklyn", "New", "York", "How", "are", "you", "getting", "along", "in", "New", "York", "and", "how", "is", "your", "brother", ",", "Major", "Wright", "?", "3", "I", "send", "him", "best", "regards.", "I", "am", "still", "here", "in", "Washington", ",", "and", "nothing", "new.", "Yours", ",", "etc.", "Walt", "Whitman"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.258261933905", "recipient": "Dana F. Wright", "organizations": [], "sender": "Walt Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/cw/tei/med.00308.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Letter from Walt Whitman to Dana F. Wright ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[["Letter", "NNP"], ["from", "IN"], [["Thomas", "NNP"], ["Jefferson", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["William", "NNP"], ["Douglas", "NNP"]], ["O'Connor", "NNP"], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Mr. W.", "Yours Cdially Thos J. Whitman"], "money": [], "year": "1865", "locations": [], "month": "Mar", "parties": ["Thomas Jefferson Whitman", "William Douglas"], "properDate": "Mar 16, 1865", "gpe": ["Brooklyn"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[40.65, -73.95]], "text": "  Brooklyn, N. Y., March 16th 18651 Mr. W. D. O'Connor2 Dr. Sir, I received this morning yours of March 14th3   I am deeply sensible of the interest you have taken for me and return my sincere and heartfelt thanks for it. The position   although very desirable in all respects is one that I am not in the least qualified to fill   it is an entirely different branch of the profession from that in which I have been engaged   My Engineering education and entire experience has been in the construction of work[s], such as laying out masonry, location and the general superintendance of building a piece of work   As a draughtsman I am totally deficient   my efforts in that direction being limited entirely to a rough pencil sketch to convey the idea of what is wanted to the workman   Therefore I am certain that I am not qualified and could not justify your generous recommendation of me for the appointment Hoping sir, that I may some time personally thank you for the trouble you have taken and kindness shown me I am very respectfully Yours Cdially Thos J. Whitman", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Brooklyn", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["N.", "NNP"], ["Y.", "NNP"], [",", ","], ["March", "NNP"], ["16th", "CD"], ["18651", "CD"], [["Mr.", "NNP"], ["W.", "NNP"]], ["D.", "NNP"], ["O'Connor2", "NNP"], ["Dr.", "NNP"], ["Sir", "NNP"], [",", ","], ["I", "PRP"], ["received", "VBD"], ["this", "DT"], ["morning", "NN"], ["yours", "NNS"], ["of", "IN"], ["March", "NNP"], ["14th3", "CD"], ["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["deeply", "RB"], ["sensible", "JJ"], ["of", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["interest", "NN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["have", "VB"], ["taken", "VBN"], ["for", "IN"], ["me", "PRP"], ["and", "CC"], ["return", "VB"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["sincere", "NN"], ["and", "CC"], ["heartfelt", "VBD"], ["thanks", "NNS"], ["for", "IN"], ["it", "PRP"], [".", "."]], [["The", "DT"], ["position", "NN"], ["although", "IN"], ["very", "RB"], ["desirable", "JJ"], ["in", "IN"], ["all", "DT"], ["r