", "Walt"], "money": [], "year": "1866", "locations": [], "month": ")", "parties": ["Walt Whitman", "Louisa Van Velsor Whitman"], "properDate": ") 0, 1866", "gpe": ["Brooklyn", "Write", "Good"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[40.65, -73.95]], "text": " . . . not sick with rheumatism or any thing   I see the carpenters in Brooklyn are demanding $4 a day   I was thinking perhaps George & Smith would just take2 . . . Write how George & Smith make out   George, how would it do for you to put up a couple of small houses, to be worth about $2000 a piece, in some good spot, outer part of the city   one of the two for us   & the other for sale   I could raise $800 cash   to leave 1200 on bond & mortgage   some such plan   you & Smith could do much of the work yourselves   I only mention it to see whether it would be practicable. Good bye, dear mother, Walt. ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[".", "."]], [[".", "."]], [[".", "."]], [["not", "RB"], ["sick", "VBP"], ["with", "IN"], ["rheumatism", "NN"], ["or", "CC"], ["any", "DT"], ["thing", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["see", "VBP"], ["the", "DT"], ["carpenters", "NNS"], ["in", "IN"], [["Brooklyn", "NNP"]], ["are", "VBP"], ["demanding", "VBG"], ["$", "$"], ["4", "CD"], ["a", "DT"], ["day", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["was", "VBD"], ["thinking", "VBG"], ["perhaps", "RB"], [["George", "NNP"]], ["&", "CC"], [["Smith", "NNP"]], ["would", "MD"], ["just", "RB"], [["take2", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [[".", "."]], [[".", "."]], [[["Write", "NNP"]], ["how", "WRB"], [["George", "NNP"]], ["&", "CC"], [["Smith", "NNP"]], ["make", "VBP"], ["out", "RP"], [["George", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["how", "WRB"], ["would", "MD"], ["it", "PRP"], ["do", "VB"], ["for", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["to", "TO"], ["put", "VB"], ["up", "RP"], ["a", "DT"], ["couple", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["small", "JJ"], ["houses", "NNS"], [",", ","], ["to", "TO"], ["be", "VB"], ["worth", "JJ"], ["about", "IN"], ["$", "$"], ["2000", "CD"], ["a", "DT"], ["piece", "NN"], [",", ","], 