ender": "Walt Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/cw/tei/tex.00149.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Letter from Walt Whitman to Louisa Van Velsor Whitman ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[["Letter", "NNP"], ["from", "IN"], [["Horace", "NNP"], ["Wentworth", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Walt", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Yours Resptly"], "money": [], "year": "1866", "locations": [], "month": "Nov", "parties": ["Horace Wentworth", "Walt Whitman"], "properDate": "Nov 16, 1866", "gpe": ["Boston", "Thayer"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[42.3584308, -71.0597732], [36.5245064, -91.53819670000001]], "text": "  Boston Nov 16 1866  Mr W. Whitman Dear Sir I own the Stereotype plates of your Poem, \"Leaves of Grass\" I bought them of the assigness of Thayer & Eldridge at the time of their failure. I should like to sell them & did not know but you would like to purchase if you could get them at the right figure. I do not know what they cost, but my impression is, that it was somewhere in the neighborhood of $800. I would be pleased to have you state what you would give for them, or to know if you could refer me to any publisher who would be likely to purchase. I think you could make better arrangements with publishers if you owned the Stereotype plates  Yours Resptly H. Wentworth  ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Boston", "NNP"]], ["Nov", "NNP"], ["16", "CD"], ["1866", "CD"], ["Mr", "NNP"], ["W.", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"], ["Dear", "NNP"], ["Sir", "NNP"], ["I", "NNP"], ["own", "JJ"], ["the", "DT"], [["Stereotype", "NNP"]], ["plates", "VBZ"], ["of", "IN"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["Poem", "NNP"], [",", ","], ["``", "``"], ["Leaves", "VBZ"], ["of", "IN"], [["Grass", "NNP"]], ["''", "''"], ["I", "PRP"], ["bought", "VBD"], ["them", "PRP"], ["of", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["assigness", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], [["Thayer", "NNP"]], ["&", "CC"], ["Eldridge", "NNP"], ["at"