"strongly", "wishes", "it", "written.", "Mother", "&", "Martha", "send", "love", ",", "&", "I", "also", ",", "most", "truly", "I", "shall", "probably", "return", "to", "Washington", "last", "of", "the", "week.", "Walt", "."], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.383652930777", "recipient": "Ellen M.", "organizations": ["St. Louis", "Water Works", "Democracy", "Galaxy"], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/nyp.00269.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to Ellen M. O'Connor ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["John", "NNP"], ["Burroughs", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["William O'Connor", "Henry Clapp", "Ethiopia", "Hamilton", "Walt Whitman"], "money": [], "year": "1867", "locations": [], "month": "Sep", "parties": ["Walt", "Whitman", "John Burroughs"], "properDate": "Sep 21, 1867", "gpe": ["Brooklyn", "Washington", "Washington", "Europe"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[40.65, -73.95], [38.8951118, -77.0363658], [38.8951118, -77.0363658], [41.4036007, -95.0138776]], "text": "  Brooklyn, September 21, 1867.                  My dear friend,              I suppose you saw my letter to William O'Connor, a week since, with notice of my safe                 arrival home, & account of one thing & another up to that date. I have                 called at the American News Company store. They have not sold many of the                 Notes   not more than a hundred. It seems to be well-known, however, & often                 talked about. I have procured & given Henry Clapp                                  a copy, at his particular request.  I have seen F. P. Church, who treated me with great courtesy   he was anxious                 about the article on Democracy   wishes to have it for                 the December number   said he would publish the little piece Ethiopia Commenting   but thought it best to keep it back till after the Democracy article                 had appeared. I have not done anything further to the latter-named piece   but shall try to                 have it ready in time for the December number. I think it likely I shall return last                 of this week to Washington. I have not received any letter at all from Washington.                 H. J. Raymond is home from Europe. Give my best respects to Mrs. Burroughs   as I am coming back so soon, I will                 mention then what I have to say on the shirt question. I am living at 1194 Atlantic                 st. opposite Hamilton street. There is nothing specially new or important among my                 folks   they all wish me to give their best regards to you.  Walt Whitman.              ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Brooklyn", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["September", "NNP"], ["21", "CD"], [",", ","], ["1867", "CD"], [".", "."]], [["My", "PRP$"], ["dear", "NN"], ["friend", "NN"], [",", ","], ["I", "PRP"], ["suppose", "VBP"], ["you", "PRP"], ["saw", "VBD"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["letter", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], [["William", "NNP"], ["O'Connor", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["a", "DT"], ["week", "NN"], ["since", "IN"], [",", ","], ["with", "IN"], ["notice", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["safe", "NN"], ["arrival", "NN"], ["home", "NN"], [",", ","], ["&", "CC"], ["account", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["one", "CD"], ["thing", "NN"], ["&", "CC"], ["another", "DT"], ["up", "RP"], ["to", "TO"], ["that", "DT"], ["date", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["called", "VBN"], ["at", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], [["American", "NNP"], ["News", "NNP"], ["Company", "NNP"]], ["store", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["They", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["not", "RB"], ["sold", "VBN"], ["many", "JJ"], ["of", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["Notes", "NNPS"], ["not", "RB"], ["more", "RBR"], ["than", "IN"], ["a", "DT"], ["hundred", "CD"], [".", "."]], [["It", "PRP"], ["seems", "VBZ"], ["to", "TO"], ["be",