       for bound books   & now, under that state of things, I suppose it will not                 be possible for him to do the work. "], "words": ["Washington", "Oct.", "13", "Dear", "Sir", ":", "I", "write", "to", "ask", "your", "kind", "offices", "in", "the", "following", "described", "matter", ":", "I", "sent", "to", "Doolady", "six", "weeks", "ago", "an", "order", "Mr.", "James", "Gray", ",", "Bookbinder", "16", "Spruce", "st.", "14th", "floor", ",", "is", "the", "custodian", "of", "the", "sheets", "of", "my", "Leaves", "of", "Grass", ",", "&", "has", "been", "the", "binder", "for", "me.", "The", "sheets", "are", "now", "at", "his", "place.", "I", "hear", "that", "he", "has", "become", "involved", "in", "fact", "has", "failed.", "If", "so", ",", "I", "regret", "it", "much.", "I", "have", "been", "waiting", "now", "over", "six", "weeks", "for", "the", "fulfilment", "of", "orders", "I", "have", "sent", "him", "for", "bound", "books", "&", "now", ",", "under", "that", "state", "of", "things", ",", "I", "suppose", "it", "will", "not", "be", "possible", "for", "him", "to", "do", "the", "work", "."], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.386644906841", "recipient": "Dionysius Thomas", "organizations": ["Bookbinder"], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/duk.00649.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to Dionysius Thomas ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Francis", "NNP"], ["P.", "NNP"], ["Church", "NNP"]], ["and", "CC"], [["William", "NNP"], ["C.", "NNP"], ["Church", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Walt Whitman"], "money": [], "year": "1867", "locations": [], "month": "Oct", "parties": ["Walt", "Whitman", "Francis P. Church", "William C. Church"], "properDate": "Oct 13, 1867", "gpe": ["Washington", "Democracy", "Galaxy"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[38.8951118, -77.0363658]], "text": "  Washington,                     October 13, 1867.                                  Messrs. Church.                                  Gentlemen:              I write merely to say that I have finished the article on Democracy;                  (that will be its name.) I feel persuaded that it will please you thoroughly.                  It will make thirteen pages in Galaxy   the arrangement that it appear as leader in December number, being of course carried out.              It will reach your hands by or before Monday next, 21st.               Walt Whitman.              ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Washington", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["October", "NNP"], ["13", "CD"], [",", ","], ["1867", "CD"], [".", "."]], [["Messrs.", "NNPS"], ["Church", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["Gentlemen", "NNS"], [":", ":"], ["I", "PRP"], ["write", "VBP"], ["merely", "RB"], ["to", "TO"], ["say", "VB"], ["that", "IN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["finished", "VBN"], ["the", "DT"], ["article", "NN"], ["on", "IN"], [["Democracy", "NNP"]], [";", ":"], ["(", ":"], ["that", "IN"], ["will", "MD"], ["be", "VB"], ["its", "PRP$"], ["name", "NN"], [".", "."]], [[")", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["feel", "VBP"], ["persuaded", "VBN"], ["that", "IN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["will", "MD"], ["please", "VB"], ["you", "PRP"], ["thoroughly", "RB"], [".", "."]], [["It", "PRP"], ["will", "MD"], ["make", "VB"], ["thirteen", "VBN"], ["pages", "NNS"], ["in", "IN"], [["Galaxy", "NNP"]], ["the", "DT"], ["arrangement", "NN"], ["that", "IN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["appear", "VBP"], ["as", "IN"], ["leader", "NN"], ["in", "IN"], ["December", "NNP"], ["number", "NN"], [",", ","], ["being", "VBG"], ["of", "IN"], ["course", "NN"], ["carried", "VBN"], ["out", "RP"], [".", "."]], [["It", "PRP"], ["will", "MD"], ["reach", "VB"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["hands", "NNS"], ["by", "IN"], ["or", "CC"], ["before", "IN"], ["Monday", "NNP"], ["next", "JJ"], [",", ","], ["21st", "JJ"], [".", "."]], [[["Walt", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"]], [".", "