c &c                                                                                            (three or four lines on personnel as lounging along)  item the obstinacy, pertinacity or continuity of Leaves of Grass & of the personality                  of W. W. in current Literature notwithstanding all attacks & objections The poems have been republished in England, & are being translated                  by Freiligrath for publication in Germany. allude to the proposed prose work   \"Democratic Vistas.\" Cant you put in the idea of an obstinate, tenacious, determined living man,                  appearing with a will, in our easy-going imitative literature. ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["(", "NN"], ["qu", "VBD"], ["?", "."]], [[")", "NN"], ["To", "TO"], ["make", "VB"], ["a", "DT"], ["Personal", "JJ"], ["item", "NN"], ["or", "CC"], ["\u00b6", "CD"], ["for", "IN"], ["``", "``"], ["Minor", "NNP"], ["Topics", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["``", "``"], ["qu", "NN"], ["?", "."]], [["To", "TO"], ["commence", "NN"], ["for", "IN"], ["instance", "NN"], ["``", "``"], ["With", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["bright", "JJ"], [",", ","], ["crispy", "NN"], ["autumn", "NN"], ["weather", "NN"], [",", ","], [["WALT", "NNP"]], ["WHITMAN", "NNP"], ["again", "RB"], ["makes", "VBZ"], ["his", "PRP$"], ["appearance", "NN"], ["on", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["sidewalks", "NNS"], ["of", "IN"], [["Broadway", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["''", "''"], ["&", "CC"], ["c", "NN"], ["&", "CC"], ["c", "NN"], ["(", ":"], ["three", "CD"], ["or", "CC"], ["four", "CD"], ["lines", "NNS"], ["on", "IN"], ["personnel", "NN"], ["as", "IN"], ["lounging", "NN"], ["along", "IN"], [")", "CD"], ["item", "NN"], ["the", "DT"], ["obstinacy", "NN"], [",", ","], ["pertinacity", "NN"], ["or", "CC"], ["continuity", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], [["Leaves", "NNP"]], ["of", "IN"], [["Grass", "NNP"]], ["&", "CC"], ["of", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["personality", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["W.", "NNP"], ["W.", "NNP"], ["in", "IN"], ["current", "