If not that, some other.                  I place the whole business, price, &c. in your absolute control.                  Only understand that the piece is to be published here in the Galaxy for May.                  Some English magazine for May is what would suit best. In haste.               ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["My", "PRP$"], ["dear", "NN"], ["Conway", "NNP"], [",", ","], ["I", "PRP"], ["send", "VBP"], ["the", "DT"], ["accompanying", "VBG"], ["article", "NN"], ["in", "IN"], ["hopes", "NNS"], ["you", "PRP"], ["can", "MD"], ["do", "VB"], ["me", "PRP"], ["the", "DT"], ["favor", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["dispose", "VB"], ["of", "IN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["to", "TO"], ["an", "DT"], [["English", "JJ"]], ["magazine", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["The", "DT"], ["one", "CD"], ["I", "PRP"], ["first", "RB"], ["think", "VBP"], ["of", "IN"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["the", "DT"], [["Fortnightly", "NNP"], ["Review", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [["If", "IN"], ["not", "RB"], ["that", "IN"], [",", ","], ["some", "DT"], ["other", "JJ"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["place", "VBP"], ["the", "DT"], ["whole", "JJ"], ["business", "NN"], [",", ","], ["price", "NN"], [",", ","], ["&", "CC"], ["c.", "NNP"], ["in", "IN"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["absolute", "NN"], ["control", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["Only", "RB"], ["understand", "VBP"], ["that", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["piece", "NN"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["to", "TO"], ["be", "VB"], ["published", "VBN"], ["here", "RB"], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], [["Galaxy", "NNP"]], ["for", "IN"], ["May", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["Some", "DT"], [["English", "JJ"]], ["magazine", "NN"], ["for", "IN"], ["May", "NNP"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["what", "WP"], ["would", "MD"], ["suit", "VB"], ["best", "JJS"], [".", "."]], [["In", "IN"], ["haste", "NN"], [".", "."]]], "sentences": ["  My dear Conway,              I send the accompanying article in hopes you can do me the favor to dispose of it to an English magazine.", "The one I first think of is the Fortnightly Review.", "If n