                    My dear Mr. Alden:              Would the enclosed be considered opportune   & of use to you for The Citizen?                  As it has been printed before, it would not be proper to put                  \"For The Citizen\" over it   but just print it plainly. Of course it is gratuitous   & I accompany it with best respects to yourself. I have not forgotten                  your kind invitations to furnish an original piece for the paper   & hope one day to have something which will be suitable.                  I am writing very little lately. Should you print the piece,                  I wish you to do me the favor to send ten copies by mail to my address here.               Walt Whitman                 Attorney General's Office              ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Washington", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["August", "NNP"], ["27", "CD"], [",", ","], ["1868", "CD"], [".", "."]], [["My", "PRP$"], ["dear", "NN"], [["Mr.", "NNP"], ["Alden", "NNP"]], [":", ":"], ["Would", "MD"], ["the", "DT"], ["enclosed", "VBN"], ["be", "VB"], ["considered", "VBN"], ["opportune", "NN"], ["&", "CC"], ["of", "IN"], ["use", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["you", "PRP"], ["for", "IN"], ["The", "DT"], [["Citizen", "NNP"]], ["?", "."]], [["As", "IN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["has", "VBZ"], ["been", "VBN"], ["printed", "VBN"], ["before", "IN"], [",", ","], ["it", "PRP"], ["would", "MD"], ["not", "RB"], ["be", "VB"], ["proper", "JJ"], ["to", "TO"], ["put", "VB"], ["``", "``"], ["For", "IN"], ["The", "DT"], [["Citizen", "NNP"]], ["''", "''"], ["over", "IN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["but", "CC"], ["just", "RB"], ["print", "VBP"], ["it", "PRP"], ["plainly", "RB"], [".", "."]], [["Of", "IN"], ["course", "NN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["gratuitous", "JJ"], ["&", "CC"], ["I", "PRP"], ["accompany", "VBP"], ["it", "PRP"], ["with", "IN"], ["best", "JJS"], ["respects", "NNS"], ["to", "TO"], ["yourself", "PRP"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["not", "RB"], ["forgotten", "VBN"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["kind", "NN"], ["invitations", "NNS"], ["to", "TO"], ["furnish", "VB"], ["an", "DT"], ["original", "JJ"], ["piece", "NN"], ["for", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["paper", "NN"], ["&", "CC"], ["hope", "NN"], ["one", "CD"], ["day", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["have", "VB"], ["something", "NN"], ["which", "WDT"], ["will", "MD"], ["be", "VB"], ["suitable", "JJ"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["writing", "VBG"], ["very", "RB"], ["little", "JJ"], ["lately", "RB"], [".", "."]], [["Should", "MD"], ["you", "PRP"], ["print", "VB"], ["the", "DT"], ["piece", "NN"], [",", ","], ["I", "PRP"], ["wish", "VBP"], ["you", "PRP"], ["to", "TO"], ["do", "VB"], ["me", "PRP"], ["the", "DT"], ["favor", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["send", "VB"], ["ten", "VBN"], ["copies", "NNS"], ["by", "IN"], ["mail", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["address", "NN"], ["here", "RB"], [".", "."]], [[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"], ["Attorney", "NNP"], ["General", "NNP"]], ["'s", "POS"], ["Office", "NNP"]]], "sentences": ["  Washington,                     August 27, 1868.", "My dear Mr. Alden:              Would the enclosed be considered opportune   & of use to you for The Citizen?", "As it has been printed before, it would not be proper to put                  \"For The Citizen\" over it   but just print it plainly.", "Of course it is gratuitous   & I accompany it with best respects to yourself.", "I have not forgotten                  your kind invitations to furnish an original piece for the paper   & hope one day to have something which will be suitable.", "I am writing very little lately.", "Should you print the piece,                  I wish you to do me the favor to send ten copies by mail to my address here.", "Walt Whitman                 Attorney General's Office              "], "words": ["Washington", ",", "August", "27", ",", "1868.", "My", "dear", "Mr.", "Alden", ":", "Would", "the", "enclosed", "be", "considered", "opportune", "&", "of", "use", "to", "you", "for", "The", "Citizen", "?", "As", "it", "has", "been", "printed", "before", ",", "it", "would", "not", "be", "proper", "to", "put", "``", "For", "The", "Citizen", "''", "over", "it", "but", "just", "print", "it", "plainly.", "Of", "course", "it", "is", "gratuitous", "&", "I", "accompany", "it", "with", "best", "respects", "to", "yourself.", "I", "have", "not", "forgotten", "your", "kind", "invitations", "to", "furnish", "an", "original", "piece", "for", "the", "paper", "&", "hope", "one", "day", "to", "have", "something", "which", "will", "be", "suitable.", "I", "am", "writing", "very", "little", "lately.", "Should", "you", "print", "the", "piece", ",", "I", "wish", "you", "to", "do", "me", "the", "favor", "to", "send", "ten", "copies", "by", "mail", "to", "my", "address", "here.", "Walt", "Whitman", "Attorney", "General", "'s", "Office"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.430028559772", "recipient": "William Livingston Alden", "organizations": ["Citizen", "Citizen"], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/hsp.00008.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to William Livingston Alden ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Abby", "NNP"], ["H.", "NNP"], ["Price", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Dear", "Mr. Evarts", "Mother", "Helen", "Emily"], "money": [], "year": "1868", "locations": [], "month": "Sep", "parties": ["Walt", "Whitman", "Abby H. Price"], "properDate": "Sep 7, 1868", "gpe": ["Washington", "New York", "Love", "Walt"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[38.8951118, -77.0363658], [40.7143528, -74.00597309999999]], "text": "  Washington,                     September 7, 1868.                                  Dear Abby:              I have leave of absence commencing first of next week, and intend coming on to New York,                  for a while, to spend the first part of it. Are you so fixed that                  you can give me a room? You must answer candidly no, if not   please write at once   I am well as usual   nothing very new or important with me.                  The advent of the new Attorney General, Mr. Evarts, does not seem likely to affect my position here.                  But there have been many dismissals of clerks in the Departments. The O'Connors are well   the little girl has picked up amazingly   goes about, indeed, as strong & nimble as a grasshopper    In a late letter, Mother said she had not seen any thing of Helen or                  Emily for some time   I suppose you have been off in the country.              Love to all   & good bye for the present.  Walt.              ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Washington", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["September", "NNP"], ["7", "CD"], [",", ","], ["1868", "CD"], [".", "."]], [[["Dear", "NNP"]], ["Abby", "NNP"], [":", ":"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["leave", "VBP"], ["of", "IN"], ["absence", "NN"], ["commencing", "VBG"], ["first", "JJ"], ["of", "IN"], ["next", "JJ"], ["week", "NN"], [",", ","], ["and", "CC"], ["intend", "VB"], ["coming", "VBG"], ["on", "IN"], ["to", "TO"], [["New", "NNP"], ["York", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["for", "IN"], ["a", "DT"], ["while", "NN"], [",", ","], ["to", "TO"], ["spend", "VB"], ["the", "DT"], ["first", "JJ"], ["part", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["it", "PRP"], [".", "."]], [["Are", "NNP"], ["you", "PRP"], ["so", "RB"], ["fixed", "VBN"], ["that", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["can", "MD"], ["give", "VB"], ["me", "PRP"], ["a", "DT"], ["room", "NN"], ["?", "."]], [["You", "PRP"], ["must", "MD"], ["answer", "VB"], ["candidly", "RB"], ["no", "DT"], [",", ","], ["if", "IN"], ["not", "RB"], ["please", "VB"], ["write", "JJ"], ["at", "IN"], ["once", "RB"], ["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["well", "RB"], ["as", "IN"], ["usual", "JJ"], ["nothing", "NN"], ["very", "RB"], ["new", "JJ"], ["or", "CC"], ["important", "JJ"], ["with", "IN"], ["me", "PRP"], [".", "