                          Charles W. Stoddard,                 Dear Sir:              Your letters have reached me. I cordially accept your appreciation, & reciprocate your friendship.                  I do not write many letters, but like to meet people. Those tender & primitive personal relations                  away off there in the Pacific Islands, as described by you, touched me deeply.              In answer to your request, I send you my picture   it was taken three months since. I also send a newspaper.              Farewell, my friend. I sincerely thank you, & hope some day to meet you.               Walt Whitman              ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Washington", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["June", "NNP"], ["12", "CD"], [",", ","], ["1869", "CD"], [["Charles", "NNP"], ["W.", "NNP"], ["Stoddard", "NNP"]], [",", ","], [["Dear", "NNP"], ["Sir", "NNP"]], [":", ":"], ["Your", "PRP$"], ["letters", "NNS"], ["have", "VBP"], ["reached", "VBN"], ["me", "PRP"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["cordially", "RB"], ["accept", "VB"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["appreciation", "NN"], [",", ","], ["&", "CC"], ["reciprocate", "VB"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["friendship", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["do", "VBP"], ["not", "RB"], ["write", "VB"], ["many", "JJ"], ["letters", "NNS"], [",", ","], ["but", "CC"], ["like", "IN"], ["to", "TO"], ["meet", "VB"], ["people", "NNS"], [".", "."]], [["Those", "DT"], ["tender", "NN"], ["&", "CC"], ["primitive", "JJ"], ["personal", "JJ"], ["relations", "NNS"], ["away", "RB"], ["off", "IN"], ["there", "EX"], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], [["Pacific", "NNP"], ["Islands", "NNPS"]], [",", ","], ["as", "IN"], ["described", "VBN"], ["by", "IN"], ["you", "PRP"], [",", ","], ["touched", "VBD"], ["me", "PRP"], ["deeply", "RB"], [".", "."]], [["In", "IN"], ["answer", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["request", "NN"], [",", ","], ["I", "PRP"], ["send", "VBP"], ["you", "PRP"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["picture", "NN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["was", 