nd feel grateful to you for your kindness to me throughout            the books.", "I do not forget you.", "I will write again when I feel well.", "My address remains the same   Solicitor's Office, Treasury, here.", "W.W.        "], "words": ["Washington", ",", "April", "11", ",", "1873.", "My", "dear", "Rossetti", ",", "The", "bearer", "of", "this", "note", "is", "Col.", "Richard", "J.", "Hinton", ",", "of", "this", "city", "(", "though", "English", "by", "birth", ")", ",", "a", "friend", "of", "mine", ",", "who", "calls", "to", "make", "your", "acquaintance.", "Truly", "yours", ",", "Walt", "Whitman.", "I", "have", "been", "very", "ill", ",", "from", "paralysis", ",", "but", "am", "recovering.", "Your", "books", "(", "two", "sets", ")", "reached", "me", "safely", ",", "and", "gave", "me", "great", "pleasure.", "I", "am", "perfectly", "satisfied", "with", "the", "selections", "from", "my", "poems", "and", "feel", "grateful", "to", "you", "for", "your", "kindness", "to", "me", "throughout", "the", "books.", "I", "do", "not", "forget", "you.", "I", "will", "write", "again", "when", "I", "feel", "well.", "My", "address", "remains", "the", "same", "Solicitor", "'s", "Office", ",", "Treasury", ",", "here.", "W.W", "."], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.659594723242", "recipient": "William Michael Rossetti", "organizations": ["Treasury"], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/med.00427.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to William Michael Rossetti ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Mr.", "NNP"], ["French", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Mr. French", "Pardon Clerk", "Mr. French"], "money": [], "year": "1873", "locations": [], "month": "Apr", "parties": ["Walt", "Whitman", "Mr. French"], "properDate": "Apr 14, 1873", "gpe": ["Please"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [], "text": "  To the Attorney 