es. I send you three, to make it up.          I have been putting off every thing   forgetting every thing   till I feel well again   for I am still in a pretty bad way   but shall come round again by-and-by,          with the blessing of God   And so, (as Mr. Philp's messenger is waiting) I shake hands across   & abruptly bid you good bye, for this time.         Walt Whitman        My address here is Solicitor's Office, Treasury, and shall always be happy to hear from you.          ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Washington", "NNP"]], [",", ","], [["D.C.", "NNP"]], ["May", "NNP"], ["7", "CD"], [",", ","], ["1873", "CD"], [".", "."]], [["My", "PRP$"], ["dear", "NN"], [["Edmund", "NNP"], ["Yates", "NNP"]], [",", ","], [["Pardon", "NNP"]], ["me", "PRP"], ["for", "IN"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["forgetfulness", "NN"], ["about", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["pictures", "NNS"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["send", "VBP"], ["you", "PRP"], ["three", "CD"], [",", ","], ["to", "TO"], ["make", "VB"], ["it", "PRP"], ["up", "RP"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["been", "VBN"], ["putting", "VBG"], ["off", "RP"], ["every", "DT"], ["thing", "NN"], ["forgetting", "VBG"], ["every", "DT"], ["thing", "NN"], ["till", "IN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["feel", "VBP"], ["well", "RB"], ["again", "RB"], ["for", "IN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["still", "RB"], ["in", "IN"], ["a", "DT"], ["pretty", "RB"], ["bad", "JJ"], ["way", "NN"], ["but", "CC"], ["shall", "MD"], ["come", "VB"], ["round", "NN"], ["again", "RB"], ["by-and-by", "JJ"], [",", ","], ["with", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["blessing", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["God", "NNP"], ["And", "CC"], ["so", "RB"], [",", ","], ["(", ":"], ["as", "IN"], [["Mr.", "NNP"], ["Philp", "NNP"]], ["'s", "POS"], ["messenger", "NN"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["waiting", "VBG"], [")", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["shake", "VBP"], ["hands", "NNS"], ["across", "IN"], ["&", "CC"], ["abruptly", "RB"], ["bid", "VBD"], ["you", "PRP"], ["good", "JJ"], ["bye", "NN"], [",", 