all write Friday     W W        ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["Wednesday", "NNP"], ["afternoon", "NN"], ["\u00bd", ":"], ["past", "JJ"], ["3", "CD"], ["Am", "NNP"], ["still", "RB"], ["about", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["same", "JJ"], [",", ","], ["pretty", "RB"], ["feeble", "JJ"], [",", ","], ["but", "CC"], ["no", "DT"], ["worse", "NN"], ["no", "DT"], ["decidedly", "RB"], ["bad", "JJ"], ["spells", "NNS"], ["the", "DT"], ["last", "JJ"], ["three", "CD"], ["days", "NNS"], ["Consider", "NNP"], ["myself", "NN"], ["much", "RB"], ["relieved", "VBN"], ["do", "VBP"], ["not", "RB"], ["go", "VB"], ["out", "RP"], ["any", "DT"], ["expect", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["be", "VB"], ["around", "IN"], ["next", "JJ"], ["week", "NN"], ["shall", "MD"], ["write", "VB"], ["Friday", "NNP"], ["W", "NNP"], ["W", "NNP"]]], "sentences": ["  Wednesday afternoon \u00bd past 3                 Am still about the same, pretty feeble, but no worse   no decidedly bad spells          the last three days   Consider myself much relieved   do not go out any   expect to be around next week   shall write Friday     W W        "], "words": ["Wednesday", "afternoon", "\u00bd", "past", "3", "Am", "still", "about", "the", "same", ",", "pretty", "feeble", ",", "but", "no", "worse", "no", "decidedly", "bad", "spells", "the", "last", "three", "days", "Consider", "myself", "much", "relieved", "do", "not", "go", "out", "any", "expect", "to", "be", "around", "next", "week", "shall", "write", "Friday", "W", "W"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.684074527404", "recipient": "Peter Doyle", "organizations": [], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/nyp.00321.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to Peter Doyle ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Charles", "NNP"], ["W.", "NNP"], ["Eldridge", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Stevens st.", "Walt", "Whitman Is", "Evangelical Alliance"], "money": [], "year": "1873", "locations": ["West"], "month": "Oct", "parties": ["Walt", "Whitman", "Charles W. Eldridge"], "properDate": "Oct 10, 1873", "gpe": ["Camden"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[51.55170589999999, -0.1588255]], "text": "  431 Stevens st. cor West. Camden, N. J.            Friday 3 p. m.                  Dear friend,        I suppose you got my postal card. I am still about the same as then   or, if any different,          it is on the side of relief & improvement   I have the feeling to go out & try to get around   have better spirits than I could expect   but on trial, the least exertion confuses my head,          & overcomes me. But I am sitting here at present in my room, comparatively comfortable   & feel every hope that I shall be able to give better account of myself next week.          I am still clear of the pronounced bad spells of seven or eight days ago   a great gain & let-up. The weather here is fine.         Walt Whitman        Isn't that Evangelical Alliance a pretty kettle of fish? I read the Tribune through every day.          ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["431", "CD"], [["Stevens", "NNP"], ["st.", "NNP"]], ["cor", "NN"], [["West", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [[["Camden", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["N.", "NNP"], ["J.", "NNP"], ["Friday", "NNP"], ["3", "CD"], ["p.", "NNP"], ["m.", "NNP"], ["Dear", "NNP"], ["friend", "NN"], [",", ","], ["I", "PRP"], ["suppose", "VBP"], ["you", "PRP"], ["got", "VBD"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["postal", "NN"], ["card", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["still", "RB"], ["about", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["same", "JJ"], ["as", "IN"], ["then", "RB"], ["or", "CC"], [",", ","], ["if", "IN"], ["any", "DT"], ["different", "JJ"], [",", ","], ["it", "PRP"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["on", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["side", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["relief", "NN"], ["&", "CC"], ["improvement", "NN"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["the", "DT"], ["feeling",