                Condition still hopeful, & (though tedious as ever, & with relapses & bad spells,) still seem decidedly          to gain more than lose   I have written to the As. Am quite comfortable to-day.          J B was here Saturday & Sunday.         W W        ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["431", "CD"], [["Stevens", "NNP"], ["st.", "NNP"]], ["cor", "NN"], [["West", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [[["Camden", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["N.", "NNP"], ["Jersey", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["April", "NNP"], ["17", "CD"], [".", "."]], [["Condition", "NN"], ["still", "RB"], ["hopeful", "JJ"], [",", ","], ["&", "CC"], ["(", "NNP"], ["though", "IN"], ["tedious", "JJ"], ["as", "IN"], ["ever", "RB"], [",", ","], ["&", "CC"], ["with", "IN"], ["relapses", "NNS"], ["&", "CC"], ["bad", "JJ"], ["spells", "NNS"], [",", ","], [")", ":"], ["still", "RB"], ["seem", "VBP"], ["decidedly", "RB"], ["to", "TO"], ["gain", "VB"], ["more", "JJR"], ["than", "IN"], ["lose", "JJ"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["written", "VBN"], ["to", "TO"], ["the", "DT"], ["As", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["Am", "NNP"], ["quite", "RB"], ["comfortable", "JJ"], ["to-day", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["J", "NNP"], ["B", "NNP"], ["was", "VBD"], ["here", "RB"], ["Saturday", "NNP"], ["&", "CC"], ["Sunday", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["W", "NNP"], ["W", "NNP"]]], "sentences": ["  431 Stevens st. cor West.", "Camden, N. Jersey.", "April 17.", "Condition still hopeful, & (though tedious as ever, & with relapses & bad spells,) still seem decidedly          to gain more than lose   I have written to the As.", "Am quite comfortable to-day.", "J B was here Saturday & Sunday.", "W W        "], "words": ["431", "Stevens", "st.", "cor", "West.", "Camden", ",", "N.", "Jersey.", "April", "17.", "Condition", "still", "hopeful", ",", "&", "(", "though", "tedious", "as", "ever", ",", "&", "with", "relapses", "&", "bad", "spells", ",", ")", "still", "seem", "decidedly", "to", "gain", "more", "than", "lose", "I", "have", "written", "to