or of          the paper   to make you print it in the Tribune?        I am still tediously invalided here   but have not at all given up the hope of getting out of the woods, & doing some work yet.        When you come to Philadelphia, try to come over & see me.         Walt Whitman        ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["431", "CD"], [["Stevens", "NNP"], ["st.", "NNP"]], ["/", "NNP"], ["cor", "NN"], [["West", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [["/", "NN"], [["Camden", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["/", "NNP"], ["N.", "NNP"], ["Jersey", "NNP"], [",", ","], ["Dec.", "NNP"], ["5", "CD"], [".", "."]], [["My", "PRP$"], ["dear", "NN"], [["Reid", "NNP"]], [",", ","], [["Has", "NNP"]], ["n't", "RB"], ["this", "DT"], ["got", "NN"], ["vim", "NN"], ["enough", "RB"], ["from", "IN"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["point", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["view", "NN"], [",", ","], ["even", "RB"], ["as", "IN"], ["editor", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["paper", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["make", "VB"], ["you", "PRP"], ["print", "VBP"], ["it", "PRP"], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["Tribune", "NNP"], ["?", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["still", "RB"], ["tediously", "RB"], ["invalided", "VBN"], ["here", "RB"], ["but", "CC"], ["have", "VBP"], ["not", "RB"], ["at", "IN"], ["all", "DT"], ["given", "VBN"], ["up", "RP"], ["the", "DT"], ["hope", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["getting", "VBG"], ["out", "IN"], ["of", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["woods", "NNS"], [",", ","], ["&", "CC"], ["doing", "VBG"], ["some", "DT"], ["work", "NN"], ["yet", "RB"], [".", "."]], [["When", "WRB"], ["you", "PRP"], ["come", "VBP"], ["to", "TO"], [["Philadelphia", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["try", "NN"], ["to", "TO"], ["come", "VB"], ["over", "RP"], ["&", "CC"], ["see", "VB"], ["me", "PRP"], [".", "."]], [[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]]]], "sentences": ["  431 Stevens st. / cor West.", "/ Camden, / N. Jersey,           Dec. 5.", "My dear Reid,        Hasn't this got vim enough   from your point of view, even as editor of          t