een", "reading", "your", "``", "Notes", ",", "''", "&", "is", "quite", "possessed", "with", "them", "also", "``", "Dem.", "Vistas", "''", "I", "am", "writing", "very", "little", "have", "a", "piece", ",", "a", "melange", ",", "prose", "&", "verse", ",", "in", "the", "``", "Christmas", "Graphic", "''", "(", "comes", "out", "in", "a", "week", "or", "so", ",", ")", "in", "which", "I", "say", "a", "brief", "word", "about", "Emerson", "To", "eke", "out", "my", "letter", "I", "send", "a", "scrap", "from", "paper", "about", "death", "of", "a", "young", "friend", "of", "mine", "also", "another", "scrap", "also", "another", "from", "London", "Academy", ",", "(", "which", "latter", "only", "please", "return", "when", "you", "write", ")", "Best", "love", "to", "'Sula", "Merry", "Christmas", "do", "you", "get", "in", "the", "new", "house", "?", "Write", "me", "a", "good", "long", "letter", "I", "wish", "I", "was", "with", "you"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.742418060656", "recipient": "John Burroughs", "organizations": ["Wash'n Marvin"], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/nyp.00293.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to John Burroughs ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], ["the", "DT"], ["Editor", "NNP"], ["of", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], [["New", "NNP"], ["York", "NNP"]], [["Daily", "NNP"], ["Graphic", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Spiritualism", "Walt Whitman"], "money": [], "year": "1874", "locations": [], "month": "Dec", "parties": ["Walt", "Whitman", "New York", "Daily Graphic"], "properDate": "Dec 16, 1874", "gpe": ["Camden", "N.J."], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[51.55170589999999, -0.1588255]], "text": "  Camden, N.J.,           December 16.                 Your notes inviting me to write about Spiritualism reached me during a late severe spell of illness,          which will account for their 