     May 7.                            Nothing special to write about   condition much the same   Yours of last Sunday rec'd   bright here to-day but cool. Love to Mrs. & Mr. N[ash].         WW        ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["431", "CD"], [["Stevens", "NNP"], ["st.", "NNP"]], ["cor", "NN"], [["West", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [[["Camden", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["N.", "NNP"], ["Jersey", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["May", "NNP"], ["7", "CD"], [".", "."]], [["Nothing", "NN"], ["special", "JJ"], ["to", "TO"], ["write", "VB"], ["about", "IN"], ["condition", "NN"], ["much", "RB"], ["the", "DT"], ["same", "JJ"], ["Yours", "NNS"], ["of", "IN"], ["last", "JJ"], ["Sunday", "NNP"], ["rec", "NN"], ["'d", "MD"], ["bright", "RB"], ["here", "RB"], ["to-day", "JJ"], ["but", "CC"], ["cool", "NN"], [".", "."]], [[["Love", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], ["Mrs.", "NNP"], ["&", "CC"], [["Mr.", "NNP"]], ["N", "NNP"], ["[", "NNP"], ["ash", "NN"], ["]", ":"], [".", "."]], [["WW", "NNP"]]], "sentences": ["  431 Stevens st. cor West.", "Camden, N. Jersey.", "May 7.", "Nothing special to write about   condition much the same   Yours of last Sunday rec'd   bright here to-day but cool.", "Love to Mrs. & Mr. N[ash].", "WW        "], "words": ["431", "Stevens", "st.", "cor", "West.", "Camden", ",", "N.", "Jersey.", "May", "7.", "Nothing", "special", "to", "write", "about", "condition", "much", "the", "same", "Yours", "of", "last", "Sunday", "rec", "'d", "bright", "here", "to-day", "but", "cool.", "Love", "to", "Mrs.", "&", "Mr.", "N", "[", "ash", "]", ".", "WW"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.762409900721", "recipient": "Peter Doyle", "organizations": [], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/nyp.00367.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to Peter Doyle ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Peter", "NNP"], ["Doyl