back to Wash. & has written to me from there since. O'C[onnor] is well & flourishing.         I think of soon going to Wash. for a few days     W W.        ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["431", "CD"], [["Stevens", "NNP"], ["st.", "NNP"]], ["cor", "NN"], [["West", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [[["Camden", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["N.", "NNP"], ["Jersey", "NNP"], [",", ","], ["Oct.", "NNP"], ["12", "CD"], ["Your", "NNP"], ["good", "JJ"], ["letter", "NN"], ["rec", "NN"], ["'d", "MD"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["am", "VBP"], ["no", "DT"], ["worse", "NN"], ["can", "MD"], ["hardly", "RB"], ["say", "VB"], ["better", "JJR"], [",", ","], ["either", "DT"], [",", ","], ["(", "NNP"], ["though", "IN"], ["if", "IN"], ["any", "DT"], ["difference", "NN"], [",", ","], ["it", "PRP"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["that", "IN"], [")", "CD"], ["C.", "NNP"], ["W.", "NNP"], ["E", "NNP"], ["[", "NNP"], ["ldridge", "NN"], ["]", ":"], ["called", "VBN"], ["to", "TO"], ["see", "VB"], ["me", "PRP"], ["on", "IN"], ["his", "PRP$"], ["way", "NN"], ["back", "RB"], ["to", "TO"], ["Wash.", "NNP"], ["&", "CC"], ["has", "VBZ"], ["written", "VBN"], ["to", "TO"], ["me", "PRP"], ["from", "IN"], ["there", "EX"], ["since", "IN"], [".", "."]], [["O'C", "JJ"], ["[", "NN"], ["onnor", "NN"], ["]", ":"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["well", "RB"], ["&", "CC"], ["flourishing", "VBG"], [".", "."]], [["I", "PRP"], ["think", "VBP"], ["of", "IN"], ["soon", "RB"], ["going", "VBG"], ["to", "TO"], ["Wash.", "NNP"], ["for", "IN"], ["a", "DT"], ["few", "JJ"], ["days", "NNS"], ["W", "NNP"], ["W", "NNP"], [".", "."]]], "sentences": ["  431 Stevens st. cor West.", "Camden, N. Jersey,           Oct. 12                            Your good letter rec'd.", "I am no worse   can hardly say better, either, (though if any difference, it is that)   C. W. E[ldridge]         called to see me on his way back to Wash. & has written to me from there since.", "O'C[onnor] is well & flourishing.", "I think of soon going to Wash. for a few days     W W.