e had in my mind          for months to say to you.", "Your letters past   what John Burroughs told me   (and your Shakspere book)   have grafted you more on my good will & memory than you perhaps know.", "I write in haste.", "Walt Whitman        "], "words": ["431", "Stevens", "St", "&", "c", "My", "dear", "friend", ",", "Enclosed", "I", "send", "you", "a", "piece", "printed", "here", "to", "give", "a", "true", "statement", "of", "the", "situation", "&", "which", "I", "should", "be", "well", "satisfied", "to", "have", "printed", "in", "Britain.", "I", "ought", "to", "have", "written", "you", "before.", "I", "have", "read", "your", "``", "Shakspere", "''", "&", "ought", "to", "have", "thanked", "you", "for", "it.", "I", "find", "it", "full", "of", "vitality", "&", "suggestiveness", ",", "on", "themes", "that", "might", "be", "supposed", "exhausted", "years", "ago", "but", "are", "not", "at", "all", "exhausted.", "As", "I", "write", "I", "am", "feeling", "pretty", "comfortable", "much", "the", "same", "as", "for", "last", "two", "years", "no", "worse.", "John", "Burroughs", "was", "here", "with", "me", "last", "week.", "He", "is", "well.", "\ufffd", "M", "D", "Conway", "has", "called", "upon", "us.", "He", "is", "a", "good", "&", "intellectual", "man", ",", "but", "I", "do", "n't", "think", "I", "either", "got", "hold", "of", "him", ",", "nor", "he", "of", "me", ",", "at", "all.", "My", "friend", ",", "I", "must", "still", "put", "off", "for", "another", "letter", "some", "things", "I", "have", "had", "in", "my", "mind", "for", "months", "to", "say", "to", "you.", "Your", "letters", "past", "what", "John", "Burroughs", "told", "me", "(", "and", "your", "Shakspere", "book", ")", "have", "grafted", "you", "more", "on", "my", "good", "will", "&", "memory", "than", "you", "perhaps", "know.", "I", "write", "in", "haste.", "Walt", "Whitman"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.794777641779", "recipient": "Edward Dowden", "organizations": [], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/med.00441.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to Edward Dowden"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], ["an", "DT"], ["Unidentified", "NNP"]]], "people": [], "money": [], "year": "1876", "locations": [], "month": ",", "parties": ["Walt", "Whitman"], "properDate": ", 1, 1876", "gpe": [], "facility": ["Stevens Street Camden New Jersey"], "latlngs": [], "text": "  431 Stevens Street Camden New Jersey / US America                       Yours rec'd   Many thanks   shall be happy to supply you with the Book   the best way is by mail   the          price is \u00a32 sent me here by p. o. order   it is entirely safe and easy     Walt Whitman        Thanks for your offer of \"the Poetry of the Period\"   I have not seen it    ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["431", "CD"], [["Stevens", "NNP"], ["Street", "NNP"], ["Camden", "NNP"], ["New", "NNP"], ["Jersey", "NNP"]], ["/", "NNP"], ["US", "NNP"], [["America", "NNP"], ["Yours", "NNP"]], ["rec", "NN"], ["'d", "MD"], ["Many", "NNP"], ["thanks", "NNS"], ["shall", "MD"], ["be", "VB"], ["happy", "JJ"], ["to", "TO"], ["supply", "NN"], ["you", "PRP"], ["with", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["Book", "NNP"], ["the", "DT"], ["best", "JJS"], ["way", "NN"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["by", "IN"], ["mail", "NN"], ["the", "DT"], ["price", "NN"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["\u00a32", "-NONE-"], ["sent", "VBN"], ["me", "PRP"], ["here", "RB"], ["by", "IN"], ["p.", "NNP"], ["o.", "NNP"], ["order", "NN"], ["it", "PRP"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["entirely", "RB"], ["safe", "JJ"], ["and", "CC"], ["easy", "JJ"], [["Walt", "NNP"], ["Whitman", "NNP"], ["Thanks", "NNP"]], ["for", "IN"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["offer", "NN"], ["of", "IN"], ["``", "``"], ["the", "DT"], [["Poetry", "NNP"]], ["of", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], [["Period", "NNP"]], ["''", "''"], ["I", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["not", "RB"], ["seen", "VBN"], ["it", "PRP"]]], "sentences": ["  431 Stevens Street Camden New Jersey / US America                       Yours rec'd   Many thanks   shall be happy to supply you with the Book   the best way is by mail   the          price is \u00a32 sent me here by p. o. order   it is entirely safe and easy     Walt Whitman        Thanks for your offer of \"the Poetry of the Period\"   I have not seen it    "], "words": ["431", "Stevens", "Street", "Camden", "New", "Jersey", "/", "US", "America", "Yours", "rec", "'d", "Many", "thanks", "shall", "be", "happy", "to", "supply", "you", "with", "the", "Book", "the", "best", "way", "is", "by", "mail", "the", "price", "is", "\u00a32", "sent", "me", "here", "by", "p.", "o.", "order", "it", "is", "entirely", "safe", "and", "easy", "Walt", "Whitman", "Thanks", "for", "your", "offer", "of", "``", "the", "Poetry", "of", "the", "Period", "''", "I", "have", "not", "seen", "it"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.794913640691", "recipient": "", "organizations": ["America Yours", "Walt Whitman Thanks", "Poetry", "Period"], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/med.00452.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to an Unidentified"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], ["an", "DT"], ["Unidentified", "NNP"]]], "people": [], "money": [], "year": "1876", "locations": [], "month": ",", "parties": ["Walt", "Whitman"], "properDate": ", 1, 1876", "gpe": ["Camden", "New", "Excuse"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[51.55170589999999, -0.1588255]], "text": "  Camden, New Jersey           1876                            Your subscription for my Book is received   for which hearty thanks. Excuse temporary delay   the small          first edition being exhausted, & [another being in the] press. Your Volume [incomplete]        ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[[["Camden", "NNP"]], [",", ","], [["New", "NNP"]], ["Jersey", "NNP"], ["1876", "CD"], ["Your", "NNP"], ["subscription", "NN"], ["for", "IN"], ["my", "PRP$"], ["Book", "NNP"], ["is", "VBZ"], ["received", "VBN"], ["for", "IN"], ["which", "WDT"], ["hearty", "NN"], ["thanks", "VBZ"], [".", "."]], [[["Excuse", "NNP"]], ["temporary", "JJ"], ["delay", "NN"], ["the", "DT"], ["small", "JJ"], ["first", "JJ"], ["edition", "NN"], ["being", "VBG"], ["exhausted", "VBN"], [",", ","], ["&", "CC"], ["[", "NNP"], ["another", "DT"], ["being", "VBG"], ["in", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["]", "NN"], ["press", "NN"], [".", "."]], [["Your", "PRP$"], ["Volume", "NN"], ["[", ":"], ["incomplete", "JJ"], ["]", "NN"]]], "sentences": ["  Camden, New Jersey           1876                            Your subscription for my Book is received   for which hearty thanks.", "Excuse temporary delay   the small          first edition being exhausted, & [another being in the] press.", "Your Volume [incomplete]        "], "words": ["Camden", ",", "New", "Jersey", "1876", "Your", "subscription", "for", "my", "Book", "is", "received", "for", "which", "hearty", "thanks.", "Excuse", "temporary", "delay", "the", "small", "first", "edition", "being", "exhausted", ",", "&", "[", "another", "being", "in", "the", "]", "press.", "Your", "Volume", "[", "incomplete", "]"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.794913640691", "recipient": "", "organizations": [], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/prc.00044.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to an Unidentified"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Peter", "NNP"], ["Doyle", "NNP"]], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Stevens st.", "Jersey Jan", "John Burroughs"], "money": [], "year": "1876", "locations": ["West"], "month": "Jan", "parties": ["Walt", "Whitman", "Peter Doyle"], "properDate": "Jan 15, 1876", "gpe": ["Camden", "Was"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[51.55170589999999, -0.1588255]], "text": "  431 Stevens st. cor West. Camden,           N. Jersey           Jan 15.                            Nothing very new or different. Was much relieved when I heard you was out of that smash up on the road.          John Burroughs is here on a visit   we have just had dinner   Cold & wintry here, but bright & clear   I go out some   your letter & paper came   am feeling quite comfortable     WW        ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["431", "CD"], [["Stevens", "NNP"], ["st.", "NNP"]], ["cor", "NN"], [["West", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [[["Camden", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["N.", "NNP"], [["Jersey", "NNP"], ["Jan", "NNP"]], ["15", "CD"], [".", "."]], [["Nothing", "NN"], ["very", "RB"], ["new", "JJ"], ["or", "CC"], ["different", "JJ"], [".", "."]], [[["Was", "NNP"]], ["much", "RB"], ["relieved", "VBD"], ["when", "WRB"], ["I", "PRP"], ["heard", "VBP"], ["you", "PRP"], ["was", "VBD"], ["out", "RP"], ["of", "IN"], ["that", "DT"], ["smash", "NN"], ["up", "RP"], ["on", "IN"], ["the", "DT"], ["road", "NN"], [".", "."]], [[["John", "NNP"], ["Burroughs", "NNP"]], ["is", "VBZ"], ["here", "RB"], ["on", "IN"], ["a", "DT"], ["visit", "NN"], ["we", "PRP"], ["have", "VBP"], ["just", "RB"], ["had", "VBD"], ["dinner", "NN"], ["Cold", "NNP"], ["&", "CC"], ["wintry", "NN"], ["here", "RB"], [",", ","], ["but", "CC"], ["bright", "JJ"], ["&", "CC"], ["clear", "JJ"], ["I", "PRP"], ["go", "VBP"], ["out", "RP"], ["some", "DT"], ["your", "PRP$"], ["letter", "NN"], ["&", "CC"], ["paper", "NN"], ["came", "VBD"], ["am", "NN"], ["feeling", "VBG"], ["quite", "RB"], ["comfortable", "JJ"], ["WW", "NNP"]]], "sentences": ["  431 Stevens st. cor West.", "Camden,           N. Jersey           Jan 15.", "Nothing very new or different.", "Was much relieved when I heard you was out of that smash up on the road.", "John Burroughs is here on a visit   we have just had dinner   Cold & wintry here, but bright & clear   I go out some   your letter & paper came   am feeling quite comfortable     WW        "], "words": ["431", "Stevens", "st.", "cor", "West.", "Camden", ",", "N.", "Jersey", "Jan", "15.", "Nothing", "very", "new", "or", "different.", "Was", "much", "relieved", "when", "I", "heard", "you", "was", "out", "of", "that", "smash", "up", "on", "the", "road.", "John", "Burroughs", "is", "here", "on", "a", "visit", "we", "have", "just", "had", "dinner", "Cold", "&", "wintry", "here", ",", "but", "bright", "&", "clear", "I", "go", "out", "some", "your", "letter", "&", "paper", "came", "am", "feeling", "quite", "comfortable", "WW"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.796817625459", "recipient": "Peter Doyle", "organizations": [], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/nyp.00383.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to Peter Doyle ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], [["Ellen", "NNP"], ["M.", "NNP"]], ["O'Connor", "NNP"], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Stevens st.", "John Burroughs"], "money": [], "year": "1876", "locations": ["West"], "month": "Jan", "parties": ["Walt", "Whitman", "Ellen M."], "properDate": "Jan 15, 1876", "gpe": ["Camden", "Glad", "Cold"], "facility": [], "latlngs": [[51.55170589999999, -0.1588255]], "text": "  431 Stevens st. cor West. Camden,           N. Jersey.           JanJan 15.                            Glad to get your letter, this morning. Am about as at last writing   every thing more favorable than unfavorable.          John Burroughs is here on a visit. Cold & clear here, snow & sleighing   I am going out a little     WW        ", "dateText": "", "percents": [], "taggedText": [[["431", "CD"], [["Stevens", "NNP"], ["st.", "NNP"]], ["cor", "NN"], [["West", "NNP"]], [".", "."]], [[["Camden", "NNP"]], [",", ","], ["N.", "NNP"], ["Jersey", "NNP"], [".", "."]], [["JanJan", "NNP"], ["15", "CD"], [".", "."]], [[[