t your letter   write again   believe me, Helen and Abby dear,          I appreciate the letters, & most of all your persistent & faithful friendship.", "Walt Whitman        "], "words": ["Camden", "Oct", "10", ",", "1876.", "Dear", "Helen", ",", "Dear", "Abby", ",", "&", "all", "I", "am", "still", "jogging", "along", "here", "still", "just", "holding", "on", "sometimes", "(", "perhaps", "a", "quarter", "of", "the", "time", ")", "tolerably", "fair", "the", "rest", ",", "by", "the", "skin", "of", "my", "teeth", "but", "upon", "the", "whole", "with", "a", "spirit", "of", "cheerfulness", "&", "content", "with", "what", "comes", "that", "quite", "surprises", "myself.", "My", "new", "edition", "2", "Vols", "is", "out", "&", "bound", ",", "&", "pictured", "&", "autographed.", "I", "sell", "a", "few", ",", "mostly", "to", "England", "gives", "me", "a", "little", "occupation", "got", "your", "letter", "write", "again", "believe", "me", ",", "Helen", "and", "Abby", "dear", ",", "I", "appreciate", "the", "letters", ",", "&", "most", "of", "all", "your", "persistent", "&", "faithful", "friendship.", "Walt", "Whitman"], "date": [], "normalizedTime": "0.832857337141", "recipient": "Abby H. Price", "organizations": [], "sender": "Whitman", "url": "http://www.whitmanarchive.org/biography/correspondence/reconstruction/tei/pml.00043.html", "doc": {"headline": "doc", "text": ""}, "pastTO": true, "time": [], "heading": " Walt Whitman to Helen and Abby H. Price ,"}, {"taggedHeading": [[[["Walt", "NNP"]], [["Whitman", "NNP"]], ["to", "TO"], ["H.", "NNP"], ["S.", "NNP"], ["Theobold", "NNP"], [",", ","]]], "people": ["Camden"], "money": [], "year": "1876", "locations": [], "month": "Oct", "parties": ["Walt", "Whitman"], "properDate": "Oct 23, 1876", "gpe": [], "facility": [], "latlngs": [], "text": "  Camden New Jersey U S America           Oct 23                            I send to-day to same address as this card my Vol. Two Rivulets   Please notify me,          (by postal card will do